= Beyond Markets and States: Polycentric Governance of Complex Economic Systems / 超越市场与国家：复杂经济系统的多中心治理

#html.p(id: "en-S001")[#text("Contemporary research on the outcomes of diverse institutional arrangements for governing common-pool resources (CPRs) and public goods at multiple scales builds on classical economic theory while developing new theory to explain phenomena that do not fit in a dichotomous world of “the market” and “the state.” Scholars are slowly shifting from positing simple systems to using more complex frameworks, theories, and models to understand the diversity of puzzles and problems facing humans interacting in contemporary societies. The humans we study have complex motivational structures and establish diverse private-for-profit, governmental, and community institutional arrangements that operate at multiple scales to generate productive and innovative as well as destructive and perverse outcomes (North 1990, 2005).")]

#zh(id: "S001")[#text("当代研究考察在多个尺度上治理公共池资源（CPR）和公共物品的不同制度安排及其结果。这些研究以古典经济理论为基础，同时发展新的理论，解释那些无法纳入“市场”与“国家”二分世界的现象。学者正逐渐从假定简单系统，转向使用更复杂的框架、理论和模型，以理解当代社会中人们互动时面临的各种难题。我们研究的人具有复杂的动机结构，并建立各种营利性私人机构、政府机构和社区制度安排。这些安排在多个尺度上运作，既产生富有生产力和创新性的结果，也产生破坏性和反常的结果（North 1990、2005）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S002")[#text("In this article, I will describe the intellectual journey that I have taken the last half century from when I began graduate studies in the late 1950s. The early efforts to understand the polycentric water industry in California were formative for me. In addition to working with Vincent Ostrom and Charles Tiebout as they formulated the concept of polycentric systems for governing metropolitan areas, I studied the efforts of a large group of private and public water producers facing the problem of an overdrafted groundwater basin on the coast and watching saltwater intrusion threaten the possibility of long-term use. Then, in the 1970s, I participated with colleagues in the study of polycentric police industries serving U.S. metropolitan areas to find that the dominant theory underlying massive reform proposals was incorrect. Metropolitan areas served by a combination of large and small producers could achieve economies of scale in the production of some police services and avoid diseconomies of scale in the production of others.")]

#zh(id: "S002")[#text("本文将描述我的思想历程：从20世纪50年代末开始研究生学习至今，历时半个世纪。早期理解加利福尼亚多中心供水行业的努力，对我具有奠基意义。文森特·奥斯特罗姆和查尔斯·蒂布特提出治理都市区的多中心系统概念时，我曾与他们合作；同时，我研究了大量私人和公共供水者的行动。他们面对沿海地下水盆地过度开采的问题，眼看着海水入侵威胁到长期利用的可能性。随后，在70年代，我与同事研究美国都市区的多中心警务行业，发现支撑大规模改革方案的主导理论并不正确。由大小不同的服务提供者共同服务的都市区，可以在某些警务服务的生产中获得规模经济，同时避免其他服务中的规模不经济。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S003")[#text("These early empirical studies led over time to the development of the Institutional Analysis and Development (IAD) framework. A common framework consistent with game theory enabled us to undertake a variety of empirical studies including a meta-analysis of a large number of existing case studies on common-pool resource systems around the world. Carefully designed experimental studies in the lab have enabled us to test precise combinations of structural variables to find that isolated, anonymous individuals overharvest from common-pool resources. Simply allowing communication, or “cheap talk,” enables participants to reduce overharvesting and increase joint payoffs, contrary to game-theoretical predictions. Large studies of irrigation systems in Nepal and forests around the world challenge the presumption that governments always do a better job than users in organizing and protecting important resources.")]

#zh(id: "S003")[#text("这些早期实证研究，逐步促成了制度分析与发展（IAD）框架。一个与博弈论相容的共同框架，使我们能够开展多种实证研究，包括对世界各地大量公共池资源案例的元分析。精心设计的实验室研究，使我们能够检验结构变量的具体组合，并发现相互隔离、匿名的个人会过度采集公共池资源。只要允许交流，即所谓“廉价沟通”，参与者就能减少过度采集，提高共同收益，这与博弈论预测相反。对尼泊尔灌溉系统和世界各地森林的大规模研究，也挑战了这样一种预设：政府在组织和保护重要资源方面总比使用者做得更好。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S004")[#text("Currently, many scholars are undertaking new theoretical efforts. A core effort is developing a more general theory of individual choice that recognizes the central role of trust in coping with social dilemmas. Over time, a clear set of findings from the microsituational level has emerged regarding structural factors affecting the likelihood of increased cooperation. Due to the complexity of broader field settings, one needs to develop more configural approaches to the study of factors that enhance or detract from the emergence and robustness of self-organized efforts within multilevel, polycentric systems. Further, the application of empirical studies to the policy world leads one to stress the importance of fitting institutional rules to a specific social-ecological setting. “One-size-fits-all” policies are not effective.")]

#zh(id: "S004")[#text("目前，许多学者正在开展新的理论探索。其中一项核心工作是发展更一般的个人选择理论，承认信任在应对社会困境中的核心作用。随着研究积累，在微观情境层面，我们已经就哪些结构因素影响合作增加的可能性，获得了一组清晰的发现。由于更广阔的实际环境十分复杂，我们需要发展更多考察因素组合的方法，研究在多层次、多中心系统中，哪些因素促进或削弱自组织行动的出现及其稳健性。此外，将实证研究应用于政策领域，就必须强调制度规则与具体社会—生态环境相匹配的重要性。“一刀切”的政策并不有效。")]

== 1. The Earlier World View of Simple Systems / 1. 早期将世界视为简单系统的观念

#html.p(id: "en-S005")[#text("In the mid-twentieth century, the dominant scholarly effort was to try to fit the world into simple models and to criticize institutional arrangements that did not fit. I will briefly review the basic assumptions that were made at that time but have been challenged by scholars around the world, including the work of Herbert Simon (1955) and Vincent Ostrom (2008).")]

#zh(id: "S005")[#text("20世纪中叶，学术界的主流努力是试图把世界装进简单模型，并批评那些与模型不符的制度安排。我将简要回顾当时的一些基本假设。这些假设已经受到世界各地学者的挑战，其中包括赫伯特·西蒙（1955）和文森特·奥斯特罗姆（2008）的工作。")]

=== A. Two Optimal Organizational Forms / A. 两种最优组织形式

#html.p(id: "en-S006")[#text("The market was seen as the optimal institution for the production and exchange of private goods. For nonprivate goods, on the other hand, one needed “the” government to impose rules and taxes to force self-interested individuals to contribute necessary resources and refrain from self-seeking activities. Without a hierarchical government to induce compliance, self-seeking citizens and officials would fail to generate efficient levels of public goods, such as peace and security, at multiple scales (Hobbes [1651] 1960; W. Wilson 1885). A single governmental unit, for example, was strongly recommended to reduce the “chaotic” structure of metropolitan governance, increase efficiency, limit conflict among governmental units, and best serve a homogeneous view of the public (Anderson and Weidner 1950; Gulick 1957; Friesema 1966). This dichotomous view of the world explained patterns of interaction and outcomes related to markets for the production and exchange of strictly private goods (Alchian 1950), but it has not adequately accounted for internal dynamics within private firms (Williamson 1975, 1986). Nor does it adequately deal with the wide diversity of institutional arrangements that humans craft to govern, provide, and manage public goods and common-pool resources.")]

#zh(id: "S006")[#text("市场被视为生产和交换私人物品的最优制度。而对于非私人物品，人们认为需要由“政府”制定规则和征税，迫使自利的个人贡献必要资源，并停止谋求私利的活动。如果没有等级制政府促使人们服从，追求私利的公民和官员就无法在多个尺度上提供有效率的公共物品，例如和平与安全（Hobbes [1651] 1960；W. Wilson 1885）。例如，有人强烈建议用单一政府单位减少都市治理的“混乱”结构，提高效率，限制政府单位之间的冲突，并最好地服务于一个被视为同质整体的公众（Anderson 与 Weidner 1950；Gulick 1957；Friesema 1966）。这种二分世界观能够解释与纯私人物品生产和交换市场有关的互动模式及其结果（Alchian 1950），却未能充分解释私人企业的内部动态（Williamson 1975、1986）。它也不能充分处理人们为治理、提供和管理公共物品及公共池资源而创造的种种制度安排。")]

=== B. Two Types of Goods / B. 两种物品

#html.p(id: "en-S007")[#text("In his classic definitional essay, Paul Samuelson (1954) divided goods into two types. Pure private goods are both excludable (individual A can be excluded from consuming private goods unless paid for) and rivalrous (whatever individual A consumes, no one else can consume). Public goods are both nonexcludable (impossible to keep those who have not paid for a good from consuming it) and nonrivalrous (whatever individual A consumes does not limit the consumption by others). This basic division was consistent with the dichotomy of the institutional world into private property exchanges in a market setting and government-owned property organized by a public hierarchy. The people of the world were viewed primarily as consumers or voters.")]

#zh(id: "S007")[#text("在那篇经典的定义性论文中，保罗·萨缪尔森（1954）把物品分为两类。纯私人物品既具有排他性——个人A若不付款，就可以被排除在消费之外——也具有竞争性——个人A消费的东西，其他人便不能消费。公共物品则既不具排他性——无法阻止未付款的人消费——也不具竞争性——个人A的消费不会限制其他人的消费。这种基本划分，与制度世界的二分相一致：一边是市场环境中的私有财产交换，另一边是由公共等级体系组织的政府所有财产。世界上的人主要被看作消费者或选民。")]

=== C. One Model of the Individual / C. 单一的个人模型

#html.p(id: "en-S008")[#text("The assumption that all individuals are fully rational was generally accepted in mainstream economics and game theory. Fully rational individuals are presumed to know (1) all possible strategies available in a particular situation, (2) which outcomes are linked to each strategy given the likely behavior of others in a situation, and (3) a rank order for each of these outcomes in terms of the individual’s own preferences as measured by utility. The rational strategy for such an individual in every situation is to maximize expected utility. While utility was originally conceived of as a way of combining a diversity of external values on a single internal scale, in practice, it has come to be equated with one externalized unit of measure – such as expected profits. This model of the individual has fruitfully generated useful and empirically validated predictions about the results of exchange transactions related to goods with specific attributes in a competitive market but not in a diversity of social dilemmas. I will return to a discussion of the theory of individual behavior in section 7A.")]

#zh(id: "S008")[#text("所有个人都完全理性的假设，在主流经济学和博弈论中普遍得到接受。完全理性的个人被假定知道：（1）特定情境下所有可用策略；（2）考虑其他人的可能行为后，每种策略对应哪些结果；（3）依据个人以效用衡量的偏好，对这些结果作出的排序。这种个人在任何情境中的理性策略，都是最大化预期效用。效用最初被设想为把多种外部价值统一到一个内部尺度的方式，但在实践中，它逐渐被等同于某个外在计量单位，例如预期利润。对于竞争市场中具有特定属性的物品交换，这一模型产生了有用且得到实证验证的结果预测；对于多种社会困境，它却不能做到这一点。我将在第7节A部分重新讨论个人行为理论。")]

== 2. Early Efforts to Develop a Fuller Understanding of Complex Human Systems / 2. 早期对复杂人类系统的更全面理解

#html.p(id: "en-S009")[#text("The mid-twentieth-century world views of simple systems have slowly been transformed as a result of extensive empirical research and the development of a framework consistent with game-theoretical models for the analysis of a broad array of questions.")]

#zh(id: "S009")[#text("通过大量实证研究，以及发展一个与博弈论模型相容、能够分析广泛问题的框架，20世纪中叶把世界看作简单系统的观念逐渐发生了转变。")]

=== A. Studying Polycentric Public Industries / A. 研究多中心公共服务行业

#html.p(id: "en-S010")[#text("Undertaking empirical studies of how citizens, local public entrepreneurs, and public officials engage in diverse ways of providing, producing, and managing public service industries and common-property regimes at multiple scales has generated substantial knowledge that is not explained by two models of optimal organizational forms. Vincent Ostrom, Charles Tiebout, and Robert Warren (1961) introduced the concept of polycentricity in their effort to understand whether the activities of a diverse array of public and private agencies engaged in providing and producing of public services in metropolitan areas was chaotic, as charged by other scholars – or potentially a productive arrangement.")]

#zh(id: "S010")[#text("实证研究考察公民、地方公共事务创业者和公共官员如何在多个尺度上，以不同方式提供、生产和管理公共服务行业及共有产权制度。这些研究积累了大量无法用两种最优组织形式模型解释的知识。文森特·奥斯特罗姆、查尔斯·蒂布特和罗伯特·沃伦（1961）提出了多中心性的概念，试图理解都市区中各种公共和私人机构提供、生产公共服务的活动，究竟像其他学者指责的那样混乱，还是可能构成一种富有生产力的安排。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S011")[#text("‘Polycentric’ connotes many centers of decision making that are formally independent of each other. Whether they actually function independently, or instead constitute an interdependent system of relations, is an empirical question in particular cases. To the extent that they take each other into account in competitive relationships, enter into various contractual and cooperative undertakings or have recourse to central mechanisms to resolve conflicts, the various political jurisdictions in a metropolitan area may function in a coherent manner with consistent and predictable patterns of interacting behavior. To the extent that this is so, they may be said to function as a ‘system’. (V. Ostrom, Tiebout, and Warren 1961: 831–32)")]

#zh(id: "S011")[#text("“多中心”意味着许多在形式上彼此独立的决策中心。它们实际上独立运作，还是构成相互依赖的关系系统，是需要在具体案例中检验的经验问题。如果它们在竞争关系中考虑彼此，开展各种契约和合作活动，或者借助中央机制解决冲突，那么都市区中的不同政治辖区便可能以协调方式运作，呈现一致且可预测的互动行为模式。在这种程度上，可以说它们构成了一个“系统”。（V. Ostrom、Tiebout 与 Warren 1961：831—832）")]

#html.p(id: "en-S012")[#text("Drawing on the concept of a public service industry (Bain 1959; Caves 1964; V. Ostrom and E. Ostrom 1965), several studies of water industry performance were carried out in diverse regions of California during the 1960s (V. Ostrom 1962; Weschler 1968; Warren 1966; E. Ostrom 1965). Substantial evidence was found that multiple public and private agencies had searched out productive ways of organizing water resources at multiple scales contrary to the view that the presence of multiple governmental units without a clear hierarchy was chaotic. Further, evidence pointed out three mechanisms that increase productivity in polycentric metropolitan areas: (1) small- to medium-sized cities are more effective than large cities in monitoring performance of their citizens and relevant costs, (2) citizens who are dissatisfied with service provision can “vote with their feet” and move to jurisdictions that come closer to their preferred mix and costs of public services, and (3) local incorporated communities can contract with larger producers and change contracts if not satisfied with the services provided, while neighborhoods inside a large city have no voice.")]

#zh(id: "S012")[#text("依据公共服务行业这一概念（Bain 1959；Caves 1964；V. Ostrom 与 E. Ostrom 1965），60年代在加利福尼亚不同地区开展了多项供水行业绩效研究（V. Ostrom 1962；Weschler 1968；Warren 1966；E. Ostrom 1965）。大量证据表明，多个公共和私人机构已经找到在不同尺度上有效组织水资源的方式，这与“缺少明确等级体系的多个政府单位必然混乱”的观点相反。此外，证据揭示了三种提高多中心都市区生产力的机制：（1）中小城市比大城市更能有效监测居民的表现及相关成本；（2）不满意服务供给的公民可以“用脚投票”，迁往公共服务组合和成本更符合自己偏好的辖区；（3）具有法人地位的地方社区可以与较大的服务生产者订约，不满意时可以更换合同，而大城市内部的街区则没有这种发言权。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S013")[#text("In the 1970s, the earlier work on effects of diverse ways of organizing the provision of water in metropolitan areas was extended to policing and public safety. We found that while many police departments served 80 metropolitan areas that we studied, duplication of services by more than one department to the same set of citizens rarely occurred (E. Ostrom, Parks, and Whitaker 1978). Further, the widely held belief that a multiplicity of departments in a metropolitan area was less efficient was not found. In fact, the “most efficient producers supply more output for given inputs in high multiplicity metropolitan areas than do the efficient producers in metropolitan areas with fewer producers” (E. Ostrom and Parks 1999: 287). Metropolitan areas with large numbers of autonomous direct service producers achieved higher levels of technical efficiency (ibid.: 290). Technical efficiency was also enhanced in those metropolitan areas with a small number of producers providing indirect services such as radio communication and criminal laboratory analyses. We were able to reject the theory underlying the proposals of the metropolitan reform approach. We demonstrated that complexity is not the same as chaos in regard to metropolitan governance. That lesson has carried forth as we have undertaken further empirical studies of polycentric governance of resource and infrastructure systems across the world (Andersson and Ostrom 2008; E. Ostrom, Schroeder, and Wynne 1993).")]

#zh(id: "S013")[#text("70年代，早期关于都市区供水组织方式的研究，被扩展到警务和公共安全。我们发现，虽然所研究的80个都市区中有许多警察部门，但两个以上部门对同一群居民重复提供服务的情况很少（E. Ostrom、Parks 与 Whitaker 1978）。我们也没有发现证据支持“都市区警察部门越多，效率越低”的普遍看法。事实上，“对于给定投入，在生产者众多的都市区，最高效的生产者提供的产出，比生产者较少的都市区中的高效生产者更多”（E. Ostrom 与 Parks 1999：287）。拥有大量自主直接服务生产者的都市区，技术效率更高（同上：290）。而无线电通信、刑事实验室分析等间接服务，若由少数生产者提供，也会提高技术效率。我们因此能够否定都市改革方案背后的理论，并证明都市治理中的复杂性不等于混乱。这一经验延续到我们对世界各地资源和基础设施系统多中心治理的后续实证研究中（Andersson 与 Ostrom 2008；E. Ostrom、Schroeder 与 Wynne 1993）。")]

=== B. Doubling the Types of Goods / B. 将物品类型增加一倍

#html.p(id: "en-S014")[#text("Studying how individuals cope with diverse public problems in the world led us to reject Samuelson’s two-fold classification of goods. Buchanan (1965) had already added a third type of good, which he called “club goods.” In relation to these kinds of goods, it was feasible for groups of individuals to create private associations (clubs) to provide themselves nonrivalrous but small-scale goods and services that they could enjoy while excluding nonmembers from participation and consumption of benefits.")]

#zh(id: "S014")[#text("研究人们如何应对现实中的各种公共问题，使我们放弃了萨缪尔森的物品二分法。布坎南（1965）此前已经增加了第三类物品，称为“俱乐部物品”。对于这种物品，人们可以组建私人协会或俱乐部，为自己提供规模较小、无竞争性的物品和服务，同时排除非会员参与及享受收益。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S015")[#text("In light of further empirical and theoretical research, we proposed additional modifications to the classification of goods to identify fundamental differences that affect the incentives facing individuals (V. Ostrom and E. Ostrom 1977).")]

#zh(id: "S015")[#text("根据进一步的实证和理论研究，我们又提出对物品分类作出调整，以识别影响个人激励的根本差异（V. Ostrom 与 E. Ostrom 1977）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S016")[#text("1. Replacing the term “rivalry of consumption” with “subtractability of use.” 2. Conceptualizing subtractability of use and excludability to vary from low to high rather than characterizing them as either present or absent. 3. Overtly adding a very important fourth type of good – common-pool resources – that shares the attribute of subtractability with private goods and difficulty of exclusion with public goods (V. Ostrom and E. Ostrom 1977). Forests, water systems, fisheries, and the global atmosphere are all common-pool resources of immense importance for the survival of humans on this earth. 4. Changing the name of a “club” good to a “toll” good, since many goods that share these characteristics are provided by small-scale public as well as private associations.")]

#zh(id: "S016")[#text("1. 用“使用的可减损性”代替“消费的竞争性”。2. 将使用的可减损性和排他性视为从低到高的连续变化，而不是简单地判定有或没有。3. 明确增加十分重要的第四类物品——公共池资源。它与私人物品共享可减损性，与公共物品共享难以排除使用者的特征（V. Ostrom 与 E. Ostrom 1977）。森林、水系统、渔业和全球大气，都是对地球上人类生存极其重要的公共池资源。4. 把“俱乐部”物品改称“收费”物品，因为许多具有这些特征的物品，既由小规模公共协会提供，也由私人协会提供。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S018")[#text("Figure 1 provides an overview of four broad types of goods that differentially affect the problems individuals face in devising institutions to enable them to provide, produce, and consume diverse goods. These four broad types of goods contain many subtypes of goods that vary substantially in regard to many attributes. For example, a river and a forest are both common-pool resources. They differ substantially, however, in regard to the mobility of the resource units produced, the ease of measurement, the time scale for regeneration, and other attributes. Specific common-pool resources also differ in regard to spatial extent, number of users, and many other factors.")]

#zh(id: "S018")[#text("图1概括了四大类物品，它们使人们在设计制度、提供、生产和消费物品时面临不同的问题。这四类物品又包含许多子类，各种属性差异很大。例如，河流和森林都是公共池资源，但它们在资源单位的流动性、测量的难易程度、再生的时间尺度以及其他属性上有很大不同。具体公共池资源之间，还存在空间范围、使用者数量及许多其他方面的差异。")]

#html.figure(id: "F001", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-01.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C001", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 1. Four types of goods. Source: Adapted from E. Ostrom, 2005: 24.")]

#zh(id: "C001")[#text("图1．四种物品。改编自 E. Ostrom，2005：24。横轴为使用的可减损性，从高到低；纵轴为排除潜在受益者的难度，从高到低。排除难且可减损性高的是公共池资源，如地下水盆地、湖泊、灌溉系统、渔业、森林；排除难且可减损性低的是公共物品，如社区和平与安全、国防、知识、消防、天气预报；排除容易且可减损性高的是私人物品，如食品、衣服、汽车；排除容易且可减损性低的是收费物品，如剧院、私人俱乐部、日托中心。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S019")[#text("When one engages in substantial fieldwork, one confronts an immense diversity of situations in which humans interact. Riding as an observer in a patrol car in the central district of a large American city at midnight on a Saturday evening, one sees different patterns of human interaction than in a suburb on a weekday afternoon when school is letting out. In both cases, one observes the production of a public good – local safety – by an official of a local government. Others who are involved in each situation differ in regard to age, sobriety, why they are there, and what they are trying to accomplish. And this context affects the strategies of the police officer one is observing.")]

#zh(id: "S019")[#text("进行大量田野调查时，人们会遇到极其多样的人类互动情境。周六午夜，作为观察者坐在美国大城市中心区的巡逻车里，看到的互动模式，与工作日下午放学时在郊区看到的截然不同。两种情况下，你都在观察地方政府官员生产一种公共物品——地方安全。但参与情境的其他人，在年龄、是否清醒、为何在场、试图做什么等方面各不相同。这种背景会影响你所观察的警员采取的策略。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S020")[#text("Contrast observing the production of a public good to watching private water companies, city utilities, private oil companies, and local citizens meeting in diverse settings to assess who is to blame for overdrafting their groundwater basin, causing massive saltwater intrusion, and what to do next. These individuals all face the same problem – the overdraft of a common-pool resource – but their behavior differs substantially when they meet monthly in a private water association, when they face each other in a courtroom, and when they go to the legislature and eventually to the citizens to sponsor a Special Replenishment District. These and many other situations observed in irrigation systems and forests in multiple countries do not closely resemble the standard models of a market or a hierarchy.")]

#zh(id: "S020")[#text("再把观察公共物品的生产，与观察私人供水公司、市政公用事业部门、私人石油公司和当地居民的会议作比较。他们在不同场合讨论：谁该为地下水盆地过度开采、导致大规模海水入侵负责，以及下一步怎么办。所有人面对的都是同一问题——公共池资源被过度开采——但在私人水协会每月开会、在法庭上对质，以及向立法机关、最终向公民发起设立特别补水区的行动中，他们的行为却十分不同。在多个国家的灌溉系统和森林中观察到的这些及其他情境，与标准市场模型或等级组织模型都不十分相像。")]

== 3. Developing a Framework for Analyzing the Diversity of Human Situations / 3. 建立分析多样人类情境的框架

#html.p(id: "en-S021")[#text("The complexity and diversity of the field settings we have studied has generated an extended effort by colleagues associated with the Workshop in Political Theory and Policy Analysis (the Workshop) to develop the IAD framework (V. Ostrom 1975; Kiser and Ostrom 1982; McGinnis 1999a, b, 2000; E. Ostrom 1986, 2005). The framework contains a nested set of building blocks that social scientists can use in efforts to understand human interactions and outcomes across diverse settings. The IAD builds on earlier work on transactions (Commons [1924] 1968), logic of the situation (Popper 1961), collective structures (Allport 1962), frames (Goffman 1974), and scripts (Schank and Abelson 1977). The approach also draws inspiration from the work of Koestler (1973) and Simon (1981, 1995), who both challenged the assumption that human behavior and outcomes are entirely based on a small set of irreducible building blocks.")]

#zh(id: "S021")[#text("我们研究的实际环境既复杂又多样，这促使政治理论与政策分析工作坊的同事持续发展IAD框架（V. Ostrom 1975；Kiser 与 Ostrom 1982；McGinnis 1999a、b、2000；E. Ostrom 1986、2005）。这个框架包含一组嵌套的构件，社会科学家可以借此理解不同环境中的人类互动及结果。IAD建立在较早有关交易（Commons [1924] 1968）、情境逻辑（Popper 1961）、集体结构（Allport 1962）、框架（Goffman 1974）和脚本（Schank 与 Abelson 1977）的研究之上。它还受到科斯特勒（1973）和西蒙（1981、1995）的启发，两人都质疑人类行为及其结果完全建立在少量不可再分构件之上的假设。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S022")[#text("While the terms frameworks, theories, and models are used interchangeably by many scholars, we use these concepts in a nested manner to range from the most general to the most precise set of assumptions made by a scholar. The IAD framework is intended to contain the most general set of variables that an institutional analyst may want to use to examine a diversity of institutional settings including human interactions within markets, private firms, families, community organizations, legislatures, and government agencies. It provides a metatheoretical language to enable scholars to discuss any particular theory or to compare theories.")]

#zh(id: "S022")[#text("许多学者把框架、理论和模型这几个词互换使用；我们则把它们理解为嵌套关系，从学者提出的最一般假设，逐步走向最精确的假设。IAD框架旨在包含制度分析者可能用于考察各种制度环境的最一般变量，包括市场、私人企业、家庭、社区组织、立法机关和政府机构中的人类互动。它提供一种元理论语言，使学者能够讨论某个具体理论，或比较不同理论。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S023")[#text("A specific theory is used by an analyst to specify which working parts of a framework are considered useful to explain diverse outcomes and how they relate to one another. Microlevel theories including game theory, microeconomic theory, transaction cost theory, and public goods/common-pool resource theories are examples of specific theories compatible with the IAD framework. Models make precise assumptions about a limited number of variables in a theory that scholars use to examine the formal consequences of these specific assumptions about the motivation of actors and the structure of the situation they face.")]

#zh(id: "S023")[#text("分析者使用具体理论，说明框架中的哪些组成部分有助于解释不同结果，以及这些部分之间的关系。博弈论、微观经济理论、交易成本理论，以及公共物品和公共池资源理论，都是与IAD框架相容的微观理论。模型则对理论中有限数量的变量作出精确假设，供学者考察有关行动者动机及其所处情境结构的具体假设，在形式上会产生什么后果。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S024")[#text("The IAD framework is designed to enable scholars to analyze systems that are composed of a cluster of variables, each of which can then be unpacked multiple times depending on the question of immediate interest. At the core of the IAD framework is the concept of an action situation affected by external variables (see Figure 2). The broadest categories of external factors affecting an action situation at a particular time include:")]

#zh(id: "S024")[#text("IAD框架旨在帮助学者分析由一组变量组成的系统。根据眼前关心的问题，每个变量还可以反复展开。框架的核心是受外部变量影响的行动情境（见图2）。在某一时刻影响行动情境的外部因素，最广泛的类别包括：")]

#html.p(id: "en-S025")[#text("1. Biophysical conditions, which may be simplified in some analyses to be one of the four types of goods defined in Figure 1. 2. Attributes of a community, which may include the history of prior interactions, internal homogeneity or heterogeneity of key attributes, and the knowledge and social capital of those who may participate or be affected by others. 3. Rules-in-use, which specify common understanding of those involved related to who must, must not, or may take which actions affecting others subject to sanctions (Crawford and Ostrom 2005). The rules-in-use may evolve over time as those involved in one action situation interact with others in a variety of settings (E. Ostrom 2008; E. Ostrom and Basurto forthcoming; Boyd and Richerson 1985) or self-consciously change the rules in a collective-choice or constitutional-choice setting.")]

#zh(id: "S025")[#text("1. 生物物理条件，在某些分析中，可以简化为图1定义的四类物品之一。2. 社区属性，包括先前互动的历史、关键属性的内部同质性或异质性，以及可能参与行动或受他人影响者的知识和社会资本。3. 实际运用的规则，规定有关人员对谁必须、不得或可以采取哪些行动，以及如何理解其结果的共同认识。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S026")[#text("The set of external variables impacts an action situation to generate patterns of interactions and outcomes that are evaluated by participants in the action situation (and potentially by scholars) and feed back on both the external variables and the action situation.")]

#zh(id: "S026")[#text("这组外部变量影响行动情境，产生互动模式和结果。行动情境的参与者——也可能包括研究者——会评价这些结果，而评价又反馈到外部变量和行动情境本身。")]

#html.figure(id: "F002", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-02.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C002", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 2. A framework for institutional analysis. Source: Adapted from E. Ostrom, 2005: 15.")]

#zh(id: "C002")[#text("图2．制度分析框架。改编自 E. Ostrom，2005：15。外部变量包括生物物理条件、社区属性和实际运用的规则；它们影响行动情境，继而产生互动与结果，并依照评价标准作出评价。结果和评价又反馈到行动情境及外部变量。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S027")[#text("The internal working parts of an action situation are overtly consistent with the variables that a theorist uses to analyze a formal game.1 This has meant that colleagues have been able to use formal game theory models consistent with the IAD framework to analyze simplified but interesting combinations of theoretical variables and derive testable conclusions from them (see Acheson and Gardner 2005; Gardner et al. 2000; Weissing and Ostrom 1993) as well as agent-based models (ABMs) (Jager and Janssen 2002; Janssen 2008). It is not feasible to develop a formal game (or even an ABM) to analyze the more complex empirical settings with many variables of relevance affecting outcomes and of importance for institutional analysis. It is possible, however, to use a common set of structural elements to develop structured coding forms for data collection and analysis. And one can design experiments using a common set of variables for many situations of interest to political economists and then examine why particular behavior and outcomes occur in some situations and not in others.")]

#zh(id: "S027")[#text("行动情境的内部构件，明确地对应于理论家分析形式博弈时使用的变量。¹ 这意味着同事们可以运用与IAD框架相容的形式博弈模型，分析简化但有意义的理论变量组合，并推导可检验的结论（见 Acheson 与 Gardner 2005；Gardner 等 2000；Weissing 与 Ostrom 1993），也可以使用基于主体的模型（ABM）（Jager 与 Janssen 2002；Janssen 2008）。对于许多变量共同影响结果、且对制度分析重要的复杂实地环境，建立形式博弈甚至ABM来全面分析并不可行。不过，我们能够用一组共同的结构要素，建立用于数据收集和分析的结构化编码表。我们也能针对政治经济学家关心的多种情境，用共同变量设计实验，进而考察为什么某种行为和结果在一些情境中出现，在另一些情境中却不出现。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S028")[#text("To specify the structure of a game and predict outcomes, the theorist needs to posit the: 1. characteristics of the actors involved (including the model of human choice adopted by the theorist); 2. positions they hold (e.g., first mover or row player); 3. set of actions that actors can take at specific nodes in a decision tree; 4. amount of information available at a decision node; 5. outcomes that actors jointly affect; 6. set of functions that map actors and actions at decision nodes into intermediate or final outcomes; and 7. benefits and costs assigned to the linkage of actions chosen and outcomes obtained.")]

#zh(id: "S028")[#text("为了明确博弈结构并预测结果，理论家需要假定：1. 行动者的特征，包括理论家采用的人类选择模型；2. 行动者占据的位置，如先行者或行玩家；3. 决策树中特定节点上可以采取的行动；4. 决策节点上可获得的信息量；5. 行动者共同影响的结果；6. 把决策节点上的行动者和行动映射为中间或最终结果的一组函数；7. 赋予所选行动与所得结果之间联系的收益和成本。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S029")[#text("These are also the internal working parts of an action situation as shown in Figure 3. As discussed below, using a common framework across a wide diversity of studies has enabled a greater cumulation of understanding of interactions and outcomes in very complex environments. The IAD framework overtly embeds a particular situation of interest in a broader setting of external variables, some of which can be self-consciously revised over time.")]

#zh(id: "S029")[#text("这些也是图3所示的行动情境内部构件。如后文所述，在多种研究中使用共同框架，使我们能够不断积累对高度复杂环境中互动和结果的理解。IAD框架明确地把关注的具体情境嵌入更广泛的外部变量环境，其中一些变量可以随着时间推移由人们有意识地修改。")]

#html.figure(id: "F003", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-03.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C003", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 3. The internal structure of an action situation. Source: Adapted from E. Ostrom, 2005: 33.")]

#zh(id: "C003")[#text("图3．行动情境的内部结构。改编自 E. Ostrom，2005：33。外部变量影响行动者、所处位置和可采取的行动；关于潜在结果的信息、对结果的控制，以及分配给结果的净成本和收益，共同构成行动情境。")]

== 4. Are Rational Individuals Helplessly Trapped in Social Dilemmas? / 4. 理性的个人是否无助地困在社会困境中？

#html.p(id: "en-S030")[#text("The classic assumptions about rational individuals facing a dichotomy of organizational forms and of goods hide the potentially productive efforts of individuals and groups to organize and solve social dilemmas such as the overharvesting of common-pool resources and the underprovision of local public goods. The classic models have been used to view those who are involved in a Prisoner’s Dilemma game or other social dilemmas as always trapped in the situation without capabilities to change the structure themselves. This analytical step was a retrogressive step in the theories used to analyze the human condition. Whether or not the individuals who are in a situation have capacities to transform the external variables affecting their own situation varies dramatically from one situation to the next. It is an empirical condition that varies from situation to situation rather than a logical universality. Public investigators purposely keep prisoners separated so they cannot communicate. The users of a common-pool resource are not so limited.")]

#zh(id: "S030")[#text("经典假设认为理性的个人面对两类组织形式和两类物品，却掩盖了个人和群体通过组织来解决社会困境的潜在努力，例如公共池资源的过度采集，以及地方公共物品的供给不足。经典模型把参与囚徒困境或其他社会困境博弈的人，看作总被困在情境中，无法自己改变其结构。这一步分析使解释人类处境的理论倒退了。处于一种情境中的个人能否改变影响自身处境的外部变量，在不同情境中差异极大。这是随情境而变化的经验条件，而不是逻辑上的普遍事实。侦查人员有意把囚犯隔离，使他们无法交流；公共池资源的使用者却没有这种限制。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S031")[#text("When analysts perceive the human beings they model as being trapped inside perverse situations, they then assume that other human beings external to those involved – scholars and public officials – are able to analyze the situation, ascertain why counterproductive outcomes are reached, and posit what changes in the rules-in-use will enable participants to improve outcomes. Then, external officials are expected to impose an optimal set of rules on those individuals involved. It is assumed that the momentum for change must come from outside the situation rather than from the self-reflection and creativity of those within a situation to restructure their own patterns of interaction. As Sugden has described this approach:")]

#zh(id: "S031")[#text("当分析者把模型中的人看作困在不良情境中时，便假设这些人的外部——学者和公共官员——能够分析情境，查明为何出现适得其反的结果，并提出怎样改变实际运用的规则，才能让参与者改善结果。随后，人们期望外部官员把一套最优规则强加给有关个人。这种假设认为，改变的动力必须来自情境之外，而不是情境内部的人通过反思和创造，重新组织自己的互动模式。萨格登这样描述这一方法：")]

#html.p(id: "en-S032")[#text("Most modern economic theory describes a world presided over by a government (not, significantly, by governments), and sees this world through the government’s eyes. The government is supposed to have the responsibility, the will and the power to restructure society in whatever way maximizes social welfare; like the US Cavalry in a good Western, the government stands ready to rush to the rescue whenever the market ‘fails’, and the economist’s job is to advise it on when and how to do so. Private individuals, in contrast, are credited with little or no ability to solve collective problems among themselves. This makes for a distorted view of some important economic and political issues. (Sugden 1986: 3; emphasis in original)")]

#zh(id: "S032")[#text("大多数现代经济理论描述的世界由一个政府主导——值得注意的是，不是多个政府——并从政府的眼睛观察这个世界。政府被认为具有责任、意愿和权力，能够以最大化社会福利的方式重塑社会；如同优秀西部片中的美国骑兵，市场一旦“失灵”，政府就随时准备赶来救援，经济学家的任务则是建议它何时、怎样行动。相比之下，私人个体几乎不被认为有能力相互解决集体问题。这使一些重要经济和政治问题呈现出扭曲的面貌。（Sugden 1986：3；强调为原文所有）")]

#html.p(id: "en-S033")[#text("Garrett Hardin’s (1968) portrayal of the users of a common-pool resource – a pasture open to all – being trapped in an inexorable tragedy of overuse and destruction has been widely accepted since it was consistent with the prediction of no cooperation in a Prisoner’s Dilemma or other social dilemma games. It captured the attention of scholars and policymakers across the world. Many presumed that all common-pool resources were owned by no one. Thus, it was thought that government officials had to impose new external variables (e.g., new policies) to prevent destruction by users who could not do anything other than destroy the resources on which their own future (as well as the rest of our futures) depended.")]

#zh(id: "S033")[#text("加勒特·哈丁（1968）把公共池资源——一块向所有人开放的牧场——的使用者，描绘成困于过度利用和毁灭的不可避免悲剧之中。这种描述因与囚徒困境及其他社会困境博弈中的不合作预测一致，而广为接受，引起世界各地学者和政策制定者的注意。许多人假定所有公共池资源都无人所有。因此，他们认为政府官员必须引入新的外部变量，如新政策，以阻止使用者毁坏资源；否则，使用者除了破坏自己以及所有人的未来所依赖的资源之外，什么也做不了。")]

=== A. Scholars from Diverse Disciplines Examine Whether Resource Users are Always Trapped / A. 不同学科的学者检验资源使用者是否总被困住

#html.p(id: "en-S034")[#text("Dramatic incidents of overharvested resources had captured widespread attention, while studies by anthropologists, economic historians, engineers, historians, philosophers, and political scientists of local governance of small to medium-scale common-pool resources over long periods of time were not noticed by many theorists and public officials (see Netting 1972; McCay and Acheson 1987; Coward 1980). Cumulation of the knowledge contained in these studies did not occur, due to the fact that the studies were written by scholars in diverse disciplines focusing on different types of resources located in many countries.")]

#zh(id: "S034")[#text("资源被过度采集的戏剧性事件，引起了广泛关注；而人类学家、经济史学家、工程师、历史学家、哲学家和政治学家，关于长期治理中小规模公共池资源的地方实践研究，却没有受到许多理论家和公共官员注意（见 Netting 1972；McCay 与 Acheson 1987；Coward 1980）。这些研究分别由不同学科的学者撰写，关注不同国家、不同类型的资源，因此其中的知识没有积累整合起来。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S035")[#text("Fortunately, the National Research Council (NRC) established a committee in the mid-1980s to assess diverse institutional arrangements for effective conservation and utilization of jointly managed resources. The NRC committee brought scholars from multiple disciplines together and used the IAD framework in an effort to begin to identify common variables in cases where users had organized or failed to organize (Oakerson 1986; NRC 1986). Finding multiple cases where resource users were successful in organizing themselves challenged the presumption that it was impossible for resource users to solve their own problems of overuse. The NRC report opened up the possibility of a diversity of studies using multiple methods. The NRC effort also stimulated an extended research program at the Workshop that involved coding and analyzing case studies of common-pool resources written by other scholars.")]

#zh(id: "S035")[#text("幸运的是，国家研究委员会（NRC）在80年代中期设立委员会，评估有效保护和利用共同管理资源的不同制度安排。委员会汇集了多个学科的学者，运用IAD框架，尝试识别使用者组织成功或失败案例中的共同变量（Oakerson 1986；NRC 1986）。找到多个使用者成功自我组织的案例，挑战了资源使用者不可能解决自身过度利用问题的假设。NRC报告为运用多种方法开展不同研究打开了道路。它也推动工作坊开展持续的研究计划，编码和分析其他学者撰写的公共池资源案例。")]

=== B. Meta-Analyses of Common-Pool Resource Cases / B. 公共池资源案例的元分析

#html.p(id: "en-S036")[#text("In an effort to learn more than just the existence of multiple cases where resource users had self-organized, colleagues at the Workshop undertook a meta-analysis of existing case studies that were identified as a result of the activities of the NRC panel.2 Because of our prior studies of complex urban systems and the development of a framework and common language for linking the parts of complex systems, we could use the framework to help organize our efforts. The IAD framework became the foundation for designing a coding manual that was used to record a consistent set of variables for each common-pool resource study.")]

#zh(id: "S036")[#text("为了获得比“使用者自组织的案例确实存在”更深入的认识，工作坊同事对NRC小组活动识别出的既有案例进行了元分析。² 由于我们此前研究过复杂城市系统，并建立了连接复杂系统各部分的框架和共同语言，我们可以用这个框架组织研究工作。IAD框架成为设计编码手册的基础，用于为每个公共池资源案例记录一致的一组变量。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S037")[#text("This was an immense effort. More than two years was devoted to developing the final coding manual (E. Ostrom et al. 1989). A key problem was the minimal overlap of variables identified by case study authors from diverse disciplines. The team had to read and screen over 500 case studies in order to identify a small set of cases that recorded information about the actors, their strategies, the condition of the resource, and the rules-in-use.3 A common set of variables was recorded for 44 subgroups of fishers who harvested from inshore fisheries (Schlager 1990, 1994) and 47 irrigation systems that were managed either by farmers or by a government (Tang 1992, 1994).")]

#zh(id: "S037")[#text("这是一项巨大的工作。最终编码手册的开发耗时两年多（E. Ostrom 等 1989）。关键困难是，不同学科的案例作者识别的变量很少重合。团队不得不阅读和筛选500多个案例，才找到少量同时记录行动者、策略、资源状况和实际规则的案例。³ 我们为44个近海渔业捕捞者子群体（Schlager 1990、1994），以及47个由农民或政府管理的灌溉系统（Tang 1992、1994），记录了一组共同变量。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S038")[#text("Of the 47 irrigation systems included in the analysis, 12 were managed by governmental agencies of which only 40 percent (n = 7) had high performance. Of the 25 farmer-managed, over 70 percent (n = 18) had high performance (Tang 1994: 234). Rule conformance was a key variable affecting the adequacy of water over time (ibid.: 229). None of the inshore fishery groups analyzed by Schlager were government-managed and 11 (25 percent) were not organized in any way. The other 33 subgroups had a diversity of informal rules to define who was allowed to fish in a particular location and how harvesting was restricted (Schlager 1994: 260).")]

#zh(id: "S038")[#text("所分析的47个灌溉系统中，12个由政府机构管理，其中只有40%（n＝7）表现较好；25个农民管理的系统中，超过70%（n＝18）表现较好（Tang 1994：234）。规则遵守是影响长期水量充足程度的关键变量（同上：229）。施拉格分析的近海渔业群体，没有一个由政府管理，11个群体（25%）没有任何组织。其余33个子群体则制定了各种非正式规则，规定谁可以在特定地点捕鱼，以及怎样限制捕捞（Schlager 1994：260）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S039")[#text("In addition to finding significant levels of cooperation, we found some support for earlier theoretical predictions of no cooperation in particular settings.")]

#zh(id: "S039")[#text("除了发现相当程度的合作，我们还发现，在特定情境中，一些关于不合作的早期理论预测得到支持。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S040")[#text("In CPR dilemmas where individuals do not know one another, cannot communicate effectively, and thus cannot develop agreements, norms, and sanctions, aggregate predictions derived from models of rational individuals in a noncooperative game receive substantial support. These are sparse environments and full rationality appears to be a reasonable assumption in them. (E. Ostrom, Gardner, and Walker 1994: 319)")]

#zh(id: "S040")[#text("在公共池资源困境中，如果人们互不认识、无法有效交流，因而不能形成协议、规范和制裁，那么非合作博弈中理性个人模型推导的总体预测，得到相当多的支持。这些是信息贫乏的环境，在其中，完全理性似乎是一个合理假设。（E. Ostrom、Gardner 与 Walker 1994：319）")]

#html.p(id: "en-S041")[#text("On the other hand, the capacity to overcome dilemmas and create effective governance occurred far more frequently than expected and depended upon the structure of the resource itself and whether the rules-in-use developed by users were linked effectively to this structure (Blomquist et al. 1994). In all self-organized systems, we found that users had created boundary rules for determining who could use the resource, choice rules related to the allocation of the flow of resource units, and active forms of monitoring and local sanctioning of rule breakers (ibid.: 301). On the other hand, we did not find a single case where harvesters used the “grim trigger” strategy – a form of punishment that was posited in many theoretical arguments for how individuals could solve repeated dilemmas (Dutta 1990: 264).")]

#zh(id: "S041")[#text("另一方面，克服困境并创造有效治理的能力，比预期更经常出现。这取决于资源本身的结构，以及使用者形成的实际规则是否有效地与该结构相联系（Blomquist 等 1994）。所有自组织系统中，我们都发现使用者制定了决定谁能使用资源的边界规则、分配资源单位流量的选择规则，以及积极的监测和对违规者的地方制裁（同上：301）。但我们没有发现任何一个采集者使用“冷酷触发”策略的案例；这种惩罚方式，却在许多理论论证中被用来解释人们如何解决重复困境（Dutta 1990：264）。")]

=== C. The Bundles of Property Rights Related to Common-Pool Resources / C. 公共池资源相关的产权束

#html.p(id: "en-S042")[#text("Resource economists have used the term “common property resource” to refer to fisheries and water resources (Gordon 1954; Scott 1955; Bell 1972). Combining the term “property” with “resource” introduced considerable confusion between the nature of a good and the absence or presence of a property regime (Ciriacy-Wantrup and Bishop 1975). A common-pool resource can be owned and managed as government property, private property, community property, or owned by no one (Bromley 1986). A further reason for the lack of awareness about property systems developed by local users was that many scholars presumed that unless users possessed alienation rights – the right to sell their property – they did not have any property rights (Alchian and Demsetz 1973; Anderson and Hill 1990; Posner 1975).")]

#zh(id: "S042")[#text("资源经济学家曾用“共有财产资源”一词指渔业和水资源（Gordon 1954；Scott 1955；Bell 1972）。把“财产”与“资源”结合起来，造成了物品本身的性质与产权制度存在或缺失之间的混淆（Ciriacy-Wantrup 与 Bishop 1975）。公共池资源可以作为政府财产、私人财产、社区财产被拥有和管理，也可以无人所有（Bromley 1986）。许多学者还假定，除非使用者拥有转让权，即出售财产的权利，否则就没有任何产权（Alchian 与 Demsetz 1973；Anderson 与 Hill 1990；Posner 1975）。这也是地方使用者建立的产权制度未被充分认识的原因。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S043")[#text("Schlager and Ostrom (1992) drew on the earlier work of John R. Commons ([1924] 1968) to conceptualize property-rights systems as containing bundles of rights rather than a single right. The meta-analysis of existing field cases helped to identify five property rights that individuals using a common-pool resource might cumulatively have: (1) Access – the right to enter a specified property,4 (2) Withdrawal – the right to harvest specific products from a resource, (3) Management – the right to transform the resource and regulate internal use patterns, (4) Exclusion – the right to decide who will have access, withdrawal, or management rights, and (5) Alienation – the right to lease or sell any of the other four rights. Conceiving of property-rights bundles is now widely accepted by scholars who have studied diverse property-rights systems around the world (Brunckhorst 2000; Degnbol and McCay 2007; Paavola and Adger 2005; Trawick 2001; J. Wilson et al. 1994).")]

#zh(id: "S043")[#text("施拉格和奥斯特罗姆（1992）依据约翰·R.康芒斯的早期工作（[1924] 1968），把产权制度理解为一束权利，而不是单一权利。既有实地案例的元分析，帮助识别了公共池资源使用者可能逐步拥有的五种产权：（1）进入权——进入特定财产的权利；⁴（2）提取权——从资源中采集特定产品的权利；（3）管理权——改造资源和调节内部使用方式的权利；（4）排除权——决定谁拥有进入、提取或管理权的权利；（5）转让权——出租或出售其他四种权利中任何一种的权利。研究世界各地产权制度的学者，现已广泛接受产权束的概念（Brunckhorst 2000；Degnbol 与 McCay 2007；Paavola 与 Adger 2005；Trawick 2001；J. Wilson 等 1994）。")]

=== D. Linking the Internal Parts of an Action Situation to External Rules / D. 将行动情境的内部组成与外部规则联系起来

#html.p(id: "en-S044")[#text("Actors who have specific property rights to a resource also face more fundamental rules that affect the structure of the action situations they are in. In our meta-analysis, we found an incredible array of specific rules used in different settings (e.g., who could withdraw how many resource units at what location and time, what information was required of all users, what costs and benefits were attached to which actions, etc.). As we attempted to find a consistent way of coding and analyzing this rich diversity of specific rules described by case authors, we turned again to the IAD framework. Since we had identified seven working parts of a game or action situation itself, it seemed reasonable to think of seven broad types of rules operating as external variables affecting the individual working parts of action situations (see Figure 4). The seven types of rules are:")]

#zh(id: "S044")[#text("拥有资源特定产权的行动者，还面对更根本的规则，这些规则影响其所在行动情境的结构。在元分析中，我们发现不同环境使用了惊人多样的具体规则，例如谁能在何时何地提取多少资源单位、所有使用者必须提供哪些信息、哪些行动对应哪些成本和收益。为了以一致方式编码和分析案例作者描述的丰富规则，我们再次转向IAD框架。既然已经识别了博弈或行动情境的七个内部构件，就有理由提出七大类规则，作为影响这些构件的外部变量（见图4）。这七类规则是：")]

#html.p(id: "en-S045")[#text("1. Boundary rules that specify how actors were to be chosen to enter or leave these positions; 2. Position rules that specify a set of positions and how many actors hold each one; 3. Choice rules that specify which actions are assigned to an actor in a position; 4. Information rules that specify channels of communication among actors and what information must, may, or must not be shared; 5. Scope rules that specify the outcomes that could be affected; 6. Aggregation rules (such as majority or unanimity rules) that specify how the decisions of actors at a node were to be mapped to intermediate or final outcomes; and 7. Payoff rules that specify how benefits and costs were to be distributed to actors in positions (Crawford and Ostrom 2005).")]

#zh(id: "S045")[#text("1. 边界规则，规定如何选择行动者进入或离开相应位置；2. 位置规则，规定有哪些位置，以及每个位置由多少行动者占据；3. 选择规则，规定处于某个位置的行动者可以采取哪些行动；4. 信息规则，规定行动者间的沟通渠道，以及哪些信息必须、可以或不得共享；5. 范围规则，规定哪些结果可以受到影响；6. 汇总规则，如多数决或一致同意规则，规定如何将节点上行动者的决策映射为中间或最终结果；7. 收益规则，规定如何向各位置上的行动者分配收益和成本（Crawford 与 Ostrom 2005）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S046")[#text("A useful way of thinking about institutional rules is to conceptualize what part of an action situation is affected by a rule (see Figure 4).")]

#zh(id: "S046")[#text("理解制度规则的一种有用方式，是明确一条规则究竟影响行动情境的哪个部分（见图4）。")]

#html.figure(id: "F004", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-04.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C004", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 4. Rules as exogenous variables directly affecting the elements of an action situation. Source: Adapted from E. Ostrom, 2005: 189.")]

#zh(id: "C004")[#text("图4．作为外生变量的规则，直接影响行动情境的要素。改编自 E. Ostrom，2005：189。边界规则影响行动者，位置规则影响位置，选择规则影响行动，信息规则影响信息，汇总规则影响决策与结果的连接，范围规则影响潜在结果，收益规则影响净成本和收益的分配。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S047")[#text("Conceptualizing seven broad types of rules (rather than one or two) has been upsetting to scholars who wanted to rely on simple models of interactions among humans. In addition to finding seven broad types of rules, however, we also found multiple variants of each type. For example, we found 27 boundary rules described by case study authors as used in at least one common-pool resource setting (E. Ostrom 1999: 510). Some rules specified diverse forms of residence, organizational memberships, or personal attributes that are ascribed or acquired. Similarly, we found 112 different choice rules that were usually composed of two parts – an allocation formula specifying where, when, or how resource units could be harvested and a specific basis for the implementation of the formula (such as the amount of land held, historical use patterns, or assignment through lottery) (ibid.: 512).")]

#zh(id: "S047")[#text("把规则划分为七大类，而不是一两类，使希望依赖简单人类互动模型的学者感到不安。不过，我们不仅发现了七大类规则，也发现每类规则都有多种变体。例如，案例作者记述的27种边界规则，至少分别出现在一个公共池资源环境中（E. Ostrom 1999：510）。某些规则规定了不同的居住条件、组织成员资格，或先赋和后获的个人属性。同样，我们发现112种不同选择规则，通常由两部分组成：规定何时、何地或如何采集资源单位的分配公式，以及执行公式的具体依据，例如持有土地的数量、历史使用方式或抽签分配（同上：512）。")]

=== E. Long-Surviving Resource Institutions / E. 长期存续的资源制度

#html.p(id: "en-S048")[#text("After working for several years with colleagues to code cases of successful and failed systems, I thought my next task would be to undertake careful statistical analysis to identify which specific rules were associated with successful systems. I had not yet fully absorbed the incredible number and diversity of rules that the team had recorded. In 1988, I spent a sabbatical leave in a research group organized by Reinhard Selten at the Center for Interdisciplinary Research at Bielefeld University. I struggled to find rules that worked across ecological, social, and economic environments, but the specific rules associated with success or failure varied extensively across sites. Finally, I had to give up the idea that specific rules might be associated with successful cases.")]

#zh(id: "S048")[#text("与同事连续数年编码成功和失败系统的案例之后，我以为下一步就是进行细致的统计分析，识别哪些具体规则与成功系统相关。当时我还没有充分意识到团队记录的规则数量和多样性有多惊人。1988年，我利用学术休假，参加了莱因哈德·泽尔滕在比勒费尔德大学跨学科研究中心组织的研究小组。我努力寻找在不同生态、社会和经济环境中都有效的规则，但与成功或失败相关的具体规则，在不同地点差异很大。最终，我不得不放弃具体规则可以普遍与成功案例相对应的想法。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S049")[#text("Moving up a level in generality, I tried to understand the broader institutional regularities among the systems that were sustained over a long period of time and were absent in the failed systems. I used the term “design principle” to characterize these regularities. I did not mean that the fishers, irrigators, pastoralists, and others overtly had these principles in their minds when they developed systems that survived for long periods of time. My effort was to identify a set of core underlying lessons that characterized the long sustained regimes as contrasted to the cases of failure (E. Ostrom 1990).5")]

#zh(id: "S049")[#text("把概括层次提高一级后，我试图理解那些长期持续的系统具有、失败系统缺少的更广泛制度规律。我用“设计原则”来描述这些规律。这并不意味着渔民、灌溉者、牧民等人在发展长期存续的系统时，头脑中明确装着这些原则。我的目标是识别一组核心的深层经验，区分长期存续的制度与失败案例（E. Ostrom 1990）。⁵")]

#html.p(id: "en-S050")[#text("Since the design principles are described extensively in E. Ostrom (1990, 2005), I will list only a brief updated list as developed by Cox, Arnold, and Villamayor-Tomás (2009):")]

#zh(id: "S050")[#text("这些设计原则在 E. Ostrom（1990、2005）中已有详细描述，以下只列出 Cox、Arnold 和 Villamayor-Tomás（2009）提出的简短更新版本：")]

#html.p(id: "en-S051")[#text("1A. User Boundaries: Clear and locally understood boundaries between legitimate users and nonusers are present. 1B. Resource Boundaries: Clear boundaries that separate a specific common-pool resource from a larger social-ecological system are present. 2A. Congruence with Local Conditions: Appropriation and provision rules are congruent with local social and environmental conditions. 2B. Appropriation and Provision: Appropriation rules are congruent with provision rules; the distribution of costs is proportional to the distribution of benefits.")]

#zh(id: "S051")[#text("1A．使用者边界：合法使用者与非使用者之间，存在清晰且为当地人理解的边界。1B．资源边界：特定公共池资源与更大的社会—生态系统之间，存在清晰边界。2A．符合地方条件：获取和供给规则与当地社会、环境条件一致。2B．获取与供给：获取规则与供给规则一致，成本的分配与收益的分配成比例。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S052")[#text("3. Collective-Choice Arrangements: Most individuals affected by a resource regime are authorized to participate in making and modifying its rules. 4A. Monitoring Users: Individuals who are accountable to or are the users monitor the appropriation and provision levels of the users. 4B. Monitoring the Resource: Individuals who are accountable to or are the users monitor the condition of the resource.")]

#zh(id: "S052")[#text("3．集体选择安排：受资源制度影响的大多数个人，有权参与制定和修改规则。4A．监督使用者：由对使用者负责的人，或使用者本人，监督使用者的获取和供给水平。4B．监督资源：由对使用者负责的人，或使用者本人，监督资源状况。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S053")[#text("5. Graduated Sanctions: Sanctions for rule violations start very low but become stronger if a user repeatedly violates a rule. 6. Conflict-Resolution Mechanisms: Rapid, low-cost, local arenas exist for resolving conflicts among users or with officials.")]

#zh(id: "S053")[#text("5．渐进制裁：对违反规则的制裁最初很轻，但若使用者反复违规，制裁便逐渐加强。6．冲突解决机制：存在快速、低成本的地方渠道，用于解决使用者之间，或使用者与官员之间的冲突。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S054")[#text("7. Minimal Recognition of Rights: The rights of local users to make their own rules are recognized by the government.")]

#zh(id: "S054")[#text("7．对权利的最低限度承认：地方使用者自行制定规则的权利，受到政府认可。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S055")[#text("8. Nested Enterprises: When a common-pool resource is closely connected to a larger social-ecological system, governance activities are organized in multiple nested layers.")]

#zh(id: "S055")[#text("8．嵌套组织：当公共池资源与更大的社会—生态系统紧密相连时，治理活动组织为多个嵌套层次。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S056")[#text("The design principles appear to synthesize core factors that affect the probability of long-term survival of an institution developed by the users of a resource. Cox, Arnold, and Villamayor-Tomás (2009) analyzed over 100 studies by scholars who assessed the relevance of the principles as an explanation of the success or failure of diverse common-pool resources. Two-thirds of these studies confirm that robust resource systems are characterized by most of the design principles and that failures are not. The authors of some studies that found the design principles inadequate tended to interpret them very rigidly and felt that successful systems were characterized by more flexibility. In three instances, the initial wording of the design principles was too general and did not distinguish between ecological and social conditions. Thus, I have adopted the improvements to principles 1, 2, and 4 suggested by Cox and coauthors.")]

#zh(id: "S056")[#text("设计原则似乎概括了影响资源使用者所建制度长期存续概率的核心因素。Cox、Arnold 和 Villamayor-Tomás（2009）分析了100多项研究，这些研究评估设计原则能否解释不同公共池资源系统的成功或失败。其中三分之二证实，稳健的资源系统具有大多数设计原则，而失败系统则没有。一些认为设计原则不充分的研究，把原则解释得过于僵硬，认为成功系统更为灵活。在三个方面，最初表述过于笼统，没有区分生态条件与社会条件。因此，我采用了Cox及其合作者对第1、2、4项原则的改进。")]

== 5. Conducting Experiments to Study Common-Pool Resource Problems / 5. 通过实验研究公共池资源问题

#html.p(id: "en-S058")[#text("The existence of a large number of cases where users had overcome social dilemmas in order to sustain long-term use of common-pool resources successfully challenged the presumption that this was impossible. Many variables simultaneously affect these outcomes in the field. Developing game-theoretical models of common-pool resource situations (Weissing and Ostrom 1993; E. Ostrom and Gardner 1993) has been one strategy we have used to assess the theoretical outcomes of a set of variables we have observed in the field. We have also thought it was important to examine the effect of precise combinations of variables in an experimental setting.")]

#zh(id: "S058")[#text("大量案例表明，使用者能够克服社会困境，成功维持公共池资源的长期利用，这挑战了自组织不可能实现的假设。在实地，许多变量同时影响这些结果。我们采用的一种策略，是建立公共池资源情境的博弈论模型（Weissing 与 Ostrom 1993；E. Ostrom 与 Gardner 1993），评估实地观察到的一组变量在理论上会产生什么结果。我们还认为，必须在实验环境中检验变量具体组合的影响。")]

=== A. Common-Pool Resource Experiments in University Laboratories / A. 大学实验室中的公共池资源实验

#html.p(id: "en-S059")[#text("Roy Gardner and James Walker joined me in an extended effort to build and test well-specified, game-theoretical models consistent with the IAD framework (see E. Ostrom, Walker, and Gardner 1992; E. Ostrom, Gardner, and Walker 1994). The initial CPR experiments started with a static, baseline situation that was as simple as could be specified without losing crucial aspects of the appropriation problems facing harvesters in the field. We used a quadratic payoff production function based on Gordon’s (1954) classic model. The initial resource endowment ω for each of eight subjects was a set of tokens that the subject could allocate between Market 1 (which had a fixed return) and Market 2 (which functioned as a common-pool resource with a return affected by the actions of all subjects in the experiment). Subjects received aggregated information so they did not know each individual’s actions. Each subject i could invest a portion xi of his/her endowment in the common resource (Market 2) and the remaining portion would then be invested in Market 1. The payoff function we used (E. Ostrom, Gardner, and Walker 1994: 110) was:")]

#zh(id: "S059")[#text("罗伊·加德纳和詹姆斯·沃克与我一起，持续建立和检验与IAD框架相容、设定明确的博弈论模型（见 E. Ostrom、Walker 与 Gardner 1992；E. Ostrom、Gardner 与 Walker 1994）。最初的公共池资源实验，从静态基准情境开始：在不丢失实地采集者获取资源时面临的关键问题的前提下，尽可能简化。我们采用基于戈登（1954）经典模型的二次收益生产函数。八名被试每人的初始资源禀赋ω是一组代币，可以在市场1和市场2之间分配：市场1收益固定；市场2发挥公共池资源的作用，收益受所有被试行为影响。被试获得的是汇总信息，因而不知道每个人的具体行动。每名被试i可以将禀赋中的xᵢ投入公共资源，即市场2，其余部分投入市场1。我们使用的收益函数如下（E. Ostrom、Gardner 与 Walker 1994：110）：")]

#html.div(id: "E001", class: "essay-equation")[$ u_i(x) = cases(w e &"if" x_i = 0, w(e-x_i) + (x_i / sum x_i) F(sum x_i) &"if" x_i > 0) $]

#html.p(id: "en-S060")[#text("The baseline experiment was a commons dilemma in which the game-theoretic outcome involved substantial overuse of a resource while a much better outcome could be reached if subjects were to reduce their joint allocation. The prediction from noncooperative game theory was that subjects would invest according to the Nash equilibrium – 8 tokens each for a total of 64 tokens. Subjects could earn considerably more if they reduced their allocation to a total of 36 tokens in the common-pool resource. Subjects in baseline experiments with multiple decision rounds substantially overinvested – they invested even more tokens than predicted, so the joint outcome was worse than the predicted Nash equilibrium.6")]

#zh(id: "S060")[#text("基准实验是一种公地困境：博弈论结果意味着资源被严重过度利用，但若被试减少总投入，便能获得好得多的结果。非合作博弈论预测，被试会按照纳什均衡投入——每人8枚代币，共64枚。如果把公共池资源的总投入降至36枚，他们可以赚得更多。然而，在多轮决策的基准实验中，被试明显过度投入，甚至投入了比理论预测更多的代币，使共同结果比预测的纳什均衡还差。⁶")]

#html.p(id: "en-S061")[#text("Building off prior public goods research (Isaac and Walker 1988), we then conducted a series of face-to-face communication experiments in which the same payoff function was retained. After an initial ten rounds without communication, subjects were told they could communicate with each other in a group setting before returning to their terminals to make their own private decisions. This provided an opportunity for “cheap talk.” The same outcome was predicted in these experiments as in the baseline since a subject could promise to cooperate but no external “third party” ensured that the promise was fulfilled.")]

#zh(id: "S061")[#text("依据先前公共物品研究（Isaac 与 Walker 1988），我们随后开展了一系列面对面交流实验，保留相同收益函数。最初十轮不能交流，此后被试获知，可以先以小组形式相互交流，再回到终端作出个人私下决策。这提供了“廉价沟通”的机会。理论预测仍与基准实验相同，因为一个人可以承诺合作，却没有外部“第三方”确保承诺兑现。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S062")[#text("Subjects used face-to-face communication to discuss strategies to gain the best outcomes and then to agree – if possible – on what each subject should invest. They learned about their aggregate investments after each round, but not the decision of individual subjects. This gave them information as to whether the total investments were greater than agreed upon. In many rounds, subjects kept their promises to each other. In other rounds, some defections did occur. Subjects used information about the aggregate investment levels to scold their unknown fellow subjects if the total investment was higher than they had agreed upon. The opportunity for repeated face-to-face communication was extremely successful in increasing joint returns. Findings from communication experiments are consistent with a large number of studies of the impact of face-to-face communication on the capacity of subjects to solve a variety of social dilemma problems (see E. Ostrom and Walker 1991; Orbell, van de Kragt, and Dawes 1988; Sally 1995; Balliet 2010).")]

#zh(id: "S062")[#text("被试通过面对面交流，讨论如何获得最佳结果，并在可能时就每人应投入多少达成协议。每轮后，他们知道总投入，却不知道个人决策，因此能够判断总投入是否超过约定。许多轮中，被试遵守了彼此的承诺；也有些轮出现背离。如果总投入高于约定，他们便利用汇总信息责备那些身份不明的同伴。反复面对面交流的机会，极大提高了共同收益。这些发现与大量有关面对面交流如何帮助被试解决不同社会困境的研究一致（见 E. Ostrom 与 Walker 1991；Orbell、van de Kragt 与 Dawes 1988；Sally 1995；Balliet 2010）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S063")[#text("In many field settings, resource users have devised a variety of formal or informal ways of sanctioning one another if rules are broken, even though this behavior is not consistent with the theory of norm-free, complete rationality (Elster 1989: 40–41). It was thus important to see if subjects in a controlled experimental setting would actually use their own assets to financially punish other subjects. After subjects played ten rounds of the baseline common-pool resource game, they were told that in the subsequent rounds they would have an opportunity to pay a fee in order to impose a fine on another subject. We found much more sanctioning occurred in this design than the zero level predicted.7 Subjects did increase gross benefits through their sanctioning but substantially reduced net returns due to the overuse of costly sanctions.8 Sanctioning was primarily directed at those who defected, but a few sanctions appeared to be directed at low contributors as a form of revenge by those who had fined themselves. In a further design, subjects were given a chance to communicate and decide whether or not to adopt a sanctioning system of their own. Subjects who decided to adopt their own sanctioning system achieved the highest returns achieved in any of the common-pool resource laboratory experiments – 90 percent of optimal after the fines related to the small number of defections were subtracted (E. Ostrom, Walker, and Gardner 1992).")]

#zh(id: "S063")[#text("在许多实际环境中，资源使用者已经形成多种正式或非正式的相互制裁方式，以应对违规，尽管这种行为不符合没有规范的完全理性理论（Elster 1989：40—41）。因此，需要检验受控实验中的被试是否会动用自身资产，对其他被试实施经济惩罚。被试完成十轮基准公共池资源博弈后，被告知后续轮次可以支付费用，对另一被试处以罚款。实际制裁远多于理论预测的零。⁷ 制裁提高了总收益，却因过度使用有成本的惩罚，大幅降低了净收益。⁸ 制裁主要针对背离者，但少数制裁似乎是被处罚者对低投入者实施的报复。在进一步的实验中，被试可以交流，并决定是否采用自己的制裁制度。选择建立自身制裁制度的被试，取得了所有公共池资源实验室实验中的最高收益：扣除少量背离所产生的罚款之后，达到最优收益的90%（E. Ostrom、Walker 与 Gardner 1992）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S064")[#text("The predictions of noncooperative game theory are roughly supported only when participants in a laboratory experiment do not know the reputation of the others involved in a common-pool resource dilemma and cannot communicate with them. On the other hand, when subjects communicate face-to-face, they frequently agree on joint strategies and keep to their agreements – substantially increasing their net returns. Further, communication to decide on and design a sanctioning system enables those choosing this option to achieve close to optimal returns.")]

#zh(id: "S064")[#text("只有当实验室参与者不知道其他公共池资源困境参与者的声誉、且不能与之交流时，非合作博弈论的预测才大致得到支持。另一方面，当被试面对面交流时，他们经常就共同策略达成一致并遵守协议，从而大幅提高净收益。此外，通过交流决定和设计制裁制度，可以使选择这种方式的人获得接近最优的收益。")]

=== B. Studying Common-Pool Resources in Field Experiments / B. 在田野实验中研究公共池资源

#html.p(id: "en-S065")[#text("A series of field experiments have now been conducted by colleagues in Colombia to assess whether experienced villagers who are dependent on resources make decisions about the “time spent in a forest” in a design that is mathematically consistent with those reported on above. Cardenas (2000) conducted field experiments in rural schoolhouses with over 200 users of local forests. He modified the design of the common-pool resource experiments without, and with, face-to-face communication so that villagers were asked to make decisions regarding “harvesting trees.” The outcomes of these experiments were broadly consistent with the findings obtained with university students.")]

#zh(id: "S065")[#text("哥伦比亚的同事已开展一系列田野实验，评估依赖资源且具有经验的村民，如何在与前述实验数学结构一致的设计中，决定“在森林中花费的时间”。Cardenas（2000）在乡村校舍中，对200多名当地森林使用者开展实验。他调整了有、无面对面交流的公共池资源实验设计，让村民作出“采伐树木”的决策。实验结果总体上与大学生实验的发现一致。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S066")[#text("In a different design, Cardenas, Stranlund, and Willis (2000) ran ten rounds of baseline experiments with resource users from five villages who were then given a chance to communicate face-to-face for the next set of experiments. In five additional villages, participants were told after the baseline rounds that a new regulation would go into force that mandated them to spend no more than the optimal time in the forest each round. The probability of an inspection was 1/16 per round – a low but realistic probability for monitoring rule conformance in rural areas in developing countries. If the person was over the limit imposed, a penalty was subtracted from that person’s payoff, but the penalty was not revealed to the others. Subjects in this experimental condition increased their withdrawal levels when compared to the outcomes obtained when face-to-face communication was allowed and no rule was imposed. Other scholars have also found that externally imposed regulation that would theoretically lead to higher joint returns “crowded out” voluntary behavior to cooperate (see Frey and Oberholzer-Gee 1997; Reeson and Tisdell 2008).")]

#zh(id: "S066")[#text("在另一种设计中，Cardenas、Stranlund 和 Willis（2000）先让五个村庄的资源使用者进行十轮基准实验，再在下一阶段允许面对面交流。另外五个村庄的参与者则在基准实验后，被告知将实施新规定，要求每轮在森林中花费的时间不得超过最优水平。每轮检查概率为1/16：很低，但符合发展中国家乡村监督规则遵守的现实。如果某人超过规定限额，其收益便扣除罚金，但不向其他人公开。这种条件下的被试，相比可以面对面交流且没有强制规则的被试，增加了提取资源的程度。其他学者也发现，理论上应提高共同收益的外部强制规制，会“挤出”自愿合作行为（见 Frey 与 Oberholzer-Gee 1997；Reeson 与 Tisdell 2008）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S067")[#text("Fehr and Leibbrandt (2008) conducted an interesting set of public goods experiments with fishers who harvest from an “open-access” inland lake in northeastern Brazil. They found that a high percentage (87 percent) of fishers contributed in the first period of the field experiment and that contributions leveled off in the remaining periods. Fehr and Leibbrandt examined the mesh size of the nets used by individual fishermen and found that those who contributed more in the public goods experiment used nets with bigger mesh sizes. Larger mesh sizes allow young fish to escape, grow larger, and reproduce at a higher level than if they are caught when they are still small. In other words, cooperation in the field experiment was consistent with observed cooperation related to a real CPR dilemma. They conclude that the “fact that our laboratory measure for other-regarding preferences predicts field behavior increases our confidence about the behavioral relevance of other-regarding preferences gained from laboratory experiments” (ibid.: 17).")]

#zh(id: "S067")[#text("Fehr 和 Leibbrandt（2008）对巴西东北部一个开放进入的内陆湖泊的渔民，开展了一组有意思的公共物品实验。第一轮中，很高比例的渔民——87%——作出了贡献，此后各轮贡献趋于稳定。他们还检查了个别渔民所用渔网的网眼大小，发现公共物品实验中贡献较多的人，使用网眼更大的渔网。较大的网眼使幼鱼逃脱，长大并繁殖，而不是尚小时便被捕获。换言之，田野实验中的合作，与现实公共池资源困境中观察到的合作一致。他们认为，“实验室测量的关心他人偏好能够预测实地行为，这提高了我们对实验室实验所得此类偏好具有行为意义的信心”（同上：17）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S068")[#text("In summary, experiments on CPRs and public goods have shown that many predictions of the conventional theory of collective action do not hold. More cooperation occurs than predicted, “cheap talk” increases cooperation, and subjects invest in sanctioning free-riders. Experiments also establish that motivational heterogeneity exists in harvesting or contribution decisions as well as decisions on sanctioning.")]

#zh(id: "S068")[#text("总之，公共池资源和公共物品实验表明，传统集体行动理论的许多预测不成立。合作比预测更多，“廉价沟通”增加合作，被试会投入资源惩罚搭便车者。实验还确认，在采集或贡献决策，以及制裁决策中，都存在动机的异质性。")]

== 6. Studying Common-Pool Resource Problems in the Field / 6. 在实地研究公共池资源问题

#html.p(id: "en-S069")[#text("Having conducted extensive meta-analyses of case studies and experiments, we also needed to undertake field studies where we could draw on the IAD framework to design questions to obtain consistent information about key theoretically important variables across sites.")]

#zh(id: "S069")[#text("在进行大量案例元分析和实验之后，我们还需要开展实地研究，运用IAD框架设计问题，以便在不同地点获得有关理论上重要的关键变量的一致信息。")]

=== A. Comparing Farmer- and Government-Managed Irrigation Systems in Nepal / A. 比较尼泊尔农民管理和政府管理的灌溉系统

#html.p(id: "en-S070")[#text("An opportunity to visit Nepal in 1988 led to the discovery of a large number of written studies of farmer-built and maintained irrigation systems as well as some government-constructed and managed systems. Ganesh Shivakoti, Paul Benjamin, and I were able to revise the CPR coding manual so as to include variables of specific relevance to understanding irrigation systems in a new coding manual for the Nepal Irrigation and Institutions (NIIS) project. We coded existing cases and again found numerous “missing variables” not discussed by the original author. Colleagues made several trips to Nepal to visit previously described systems in written case studies to fill in missing data and verify the data in the original study. While in the field, we were able to add new cases to the data set (Benjamin et al. 1994).")]

#zh(id: "S070")[#text("1988年访问尼泊尔的机会，让我们发现了大量关于农民建设、维护的灌溉系统，以及某些政府建设、管理系统的书面研究。Ganesh Shivakoti、Paul Benjamin 和我调整公共池资源编码手册，加入对理解灌溉系统特别重要的变量，形成“尼泊尔灌溉与制度”（NIIS）项目的新手册。我们编码既有案例，再次发现原作者未讨论的许多“缺失变量”。同事多次赴尼泊尔，访问已有书面案例中的系统，补充缺失数据，并核实原研究的数据。在实地调查期间，我们还向数据集增加了新案例（Benjamin 等 1994）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S071")[#text("In undertaking analysis of this large data set, Lam (1998) developed three performance measures that could be applied to all systems: (1) the physical condition of irrigation systems, (2) the quantity of water available to farmers at the tail end of a system at different seasons of the year, and (3) the agricultural productivity of the systems. Controlling for environmental differences among systems, Lam found that irrigation systems governed by the farmers themselves perform significantly better on all three performance measures. On the farmer-governed systems, farmers communicate with one another at annual meetings and informally on a regular basis, develop their own agreements, establish the positions of monitors, and sanction those who do not conform to their own rules. Consequently, farmer-managed systems are likely to grow more rice, distribute water more equitably, and keep their systems in better repair than government systems. While farmer systems do vary in performance, few perform as poorly as government systems – holding other relevant variables constant.")]

#zh(id: "S071")[#text("分析这个大型数据集时，Lam（1998）提出了适用于所有系统的三个绩效指标：（1）灌溉系统的物理状况；（2）一年中不同季节，系统末端农民能获得的水量；（3）系统的农业生产率。控制系统间环境差异后，他发现由农民自行治理的系统，在三个指标上都显著更好。在农民治理的系统中，农民在年度会议上及日常非正式场合相互交流，制定自身协议，设立监督者职位，并制裁不遵守规则的人。因此，农民管理的系统往往比政府系统种出更多稻米，分水更公平，维护也更好。虽然农民系统之间绩效存在差异，但在其他相关变量不变时，很少有系统像政府系统那样表现差。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S072")[#text("Over time, colleagues have visited and coded still further irrigation systems in Nepal. The earlier findings regarding the higher level of performance of farmer-managed systems was again confirmed using the expanded database containing 229 irrigation systems (Joshi et al. 2000; Shivakoti and Ostrom 2002). Our findings are not unique to Nepal. Scholars have carefully documented effective farmer-designed and operated systems in many countries including Japan (Aoki 2001), India (Meinzen-Dick 2007; Bardhan 2000), and Sri Lanka (Uphoff 1991).")]

#zh(id: "S072")[#text("随着时间推移，同事又访问和编码了更多尼泊尔灌溉系统。在扩展至229个系统的数据库中，农民管理系统绩效更高的早期发现，再次得到确认（Joshi 等 2000；Shivakoti 与 Ostrom 2002）。这些发现并非尼泊尔独有。学者已在日本（Aoki 2001）、印度（Meinzen-Dick 2007；Bardhan 2000）和斯里兰卡（Uphoff 1991）等国家，仔细记录了农民设计和运行的有效系统。")]

=== B. Studying Forests around the World / B. 研究世界各地的森林

#html.p(id: "en-S073")[#text("In 1992, Dr. Marilyn Hoskins, who headed the Forest, Trees and People Program at the Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO) of the United Nations, asked colleagues at the Workshop to draw on our experience in studying irrigation systems to develop methods for assessing the impact of diverse forest governance arrangements in multiple countries. Two years of intense development and review by ecologists and social scientists around the world led to the development of ten research protocols to obtain reliable information about users and forest governance as well as about the ecological conditions of sampled forests. A long-term collaborative research network – the International Forestry Resources and Institutions (IFRI) research program – was established with centers now located in Bolivia, Colombia, Guatemala, India, Kenya, Mexico, Nepal, Tanzania, Thailand, Uganda, and the United States, with new centers being established in Ethiopia and China (see Gibson, McKean, and Ostrom 2000; Poteete and Ostrom 2004; Wollenberg et al. 2007). IFRI is unique among efforts to study forests as it is the only interdisciplinary long-term monitoring and research program studying forests in multiple countries owned by governments, private organizations, and communities.")]

#zh(id: "S073")[#text("1992年，联合国粮食及农业组织“森林、树木与人”项目负责人Marilyn Hoskins博士，请工作坊同事运用研究灌溉系统的经验，开发评估多个国家不同森林治理安排影响的方法。经过两年密集开发，并由世界各地生态学家和社会科学家审阅，我们形成了十套研究方案，获取关于使用者、森林治理，以及抽样森林生态状况的可靠信息。一个长期合作研究网络——国际森林资源与制度（IFRI）研究计划——随后建立。目前中心位于玻利维亚、哥伦比亚、危地马拉、印度、肯尼亚、墨西哥、尼泊尔、坦桑尼亚、泰国、乌干达和美国，埃塞俄比亚和中国也正在建立新中心（见 Gibson、McKean 与 Ostrom 2000；Poteete 与 Ostrom 2004；Wollenberg 等 2007）。IFRI在森林研究中独具特点：它是唯一同时研究多个国家政府、私人组织和社区所有森林的跨学科长期监测研究计划。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S074")[#text("Forests are a particularly important form of common-pool resource given their role in climate change-related emissions and carbon sequestration (Canadell and Raupach 2008), the biodiversity they contain, and their contribution to rural livelihoods in developing countries. A “favorite” policy recommendation for protecting forests and biodiversity is government-owned protected areas (Terborgh 1999). In an effort to examine whether government ownership of protected areas is a necessary condition for improving forest density, Hayes (2006) used IFRI data to compare the rating of forest density (on a five-point scale) assigned to a forest by the forester or ecologist who had supervised the forest mensuration of trees, shrubs, and groundcover in a random sample of forest plots.9 Of the 163 forests included in the analysis, 76 were government-owned forests legally designated as protected forests and 87 were public, private, or communally owned forested lands used for a diversity of purposes. No statistical difference existed between the forest density in officially designated protected areas versus other forested areas. Gibson, Williams, and Ostrom (2005) examined the monitoring behavior of 178 forest user groups and found a strong correlation between the level of monitoring and a forester’s assessment of forest density even when controlling for whether users were formally organized, whether the users were heavily dependent on a forest, and the level of social capital within a group.")]

#zh(id: "S074")[#text("森林是一种特别重要的公共池资源，因为它与气候变化相关的排放和碳储存有关（Canadell 与 Raupach 2008），蕴含生物多样性，并为发展中国家的乡村生计作出贡献。保护森林和生物多样性的一项“热门”政策建议，是建立政府所有的保护区（Terborgh 1999）。为检验政府拥有保护区是否是改善森林密度的必要条件，Hayes（2006）利用IFRI数据，比较森林调查负责人——林业专家或生态学家——对森林密度作出的五级评分。调查对随机抽取的样地中树木、灌木和地被进行了测量。⁹ 分析包括163片森林，其中76片为政府所有、依法指定的保护林，87片则为公共、私人或共有的林地，用于多种目的。正式保护区与其他林地的森林密度，没有统计差异。Gibson、Williams 和 Ostrom（2005）考察178个森林使用者群体的监督行为，发现监督程度与林业专家对森林密度的评估高度相关；即使控制使用者是否正式组织、是否高度依赖森林，以及群体的社会资本水平，这种关系仍然成立。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S075")[#text("Chhatre and Agrawal (2008) have now examined the changes in the condition of 152 forests under diverse governance arrangements as affected by the size of the forest, collective action around forests related to improvement activities, size of the user group, and the dependence of local users on a forest. They found that “forests with a higher probability of regeneration are likely to be small to medium in size with low levels of subsistence dependence, low commercial value, high levels of local enforcement, and strong collective action for improving the quality of the forest” (ibid.: 1327). In a second major analysis, Chhatre and Agrawal (2009) focus on factors that affect tradeoffs and synergies between the level of carbon storage in forests and their contributions to livelihoods. They find that larger forests are more effective in enhancing both carbon and livelihoods outcomes, particularly when local communities also have high levels of rule-making autonomy. Recent studies by Coleman (2009) and Coleman and Steed (2009) also find that a major variable affecting forest conditions is the investment by local users in monitoring. Further, when local users are given harvesting rights, they are more likely to monitor illegal uses themselves. Other focused studies also stress the relationship between local monitoring and better forest conditions (Ghate and Nagendra 2005; E. Ostrom and Nagendra 2006; Banana and Gombya-Ssembajjwe 2000; Webb and Shivakoti 2008).")]

#zh(id: "S075")[#text("Chhatre 和 Agrawal（2008）考察了不同治理安排下152片森林的状况变化，以及森林规模、改善森林的集体行动、使用者群体大小、地方使用者对森林的依赖如何影响这些变化。他们发现，“再生概率较高的森林，往往规模中小、生活依赖程度低、商业价值低、地方执法水平高，并且存在强有力的改善森林质量的集体行动”（同上：1327）。在第二项重要分析中，两人（2009）研究影响森林碳储量与生计贡献之间权衡和协同的因素。较大森林能更有效地改善碳储存和生计结果，尤其当地方社区具有较高规则制定自主权时。Coleman（2009）以及 Coleman 与 Steed（2009）的近期研究，也发现地方使用者投入监督，是影响森林状况的重要变量。此外，获得采集权的地方使用者，更可能亲自监督非法利用。其他专题研究也强调地方监督与较好森林状况的联系（Ghate 与 Nagendra 2005；E. Ostrom 与 Nagendra 2006；Banana 与 Gombya-Ssembajjwe 2000；Webb 与 Shivakoti 2008）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S076")[#text("The legal designation of a forest as a protected area is not by itself related to forest density. Detailed field studies of monitoring and enforcement as they are conducted on the ground, however, illustrate the challenge of achieving high levels of forest regrowth without active involvement of local forest users (see Batistella, Robeson, and Moran 2003; Agrawal 2005; Andersson, Gibson, and Lehoucq 2006; Tucker 2008). Our research shows that forests under different property regimes – government, private, communal – sometimes meet enhanced social goals such as biodiversity protection, carbon storage, or improved livelihoods. At other times, these property regimes fail to provide such goals. Indeed, when governments adopt top-down decentralization policies leaving local officials and users in the dark, stable forests may become subject to deforestation (Banana et al., 2007). Thus, it is not the general type of forest governance that is crucial in explaining forest conditions; rather, it is how a particular governance arrangement fits the local ecology, how specific rules are developed and adapted over time, and whether users consider the system to be legitimate and equitable (for a more detailed overview of the IFRI research program, see Poteete, Janssen, and Ostrom 2010: chap. 5).")]

#zh(id: "S076")[#text("把森林依法指定为保护区，本身并不与森林密度相关。但对实际监督和执法的详细实地研究表明，如果当地森林使用者不积极参与，实现较高森林再生水平就很困难（见 Batistella、Robeson 与 Moran 2003；Agrawal 2005；Andersson、Gibson 与 Lehoucq 2006；Tucker 2008）。我们的研究显示，政府、私人和共有等不同产权制度下的森林，有时能够实现保护生物多样性、储存碳或改善生计等更高社会目标，有时却不能。当政府采取自上而下的分权政策，使地方官员和使用者不知情时，原本稳定的森林可能转而遭到砍伐（Banana 等 2007）。因此，解释森林状况的关键不是一般的治理类型，而是具体治理安排如何匹配当地生态，具体规则如何形成并随时间调整，以及使用者是否认为制度合法且公平。关于IFRI研究计划的更详细概述，见 Poteete、Janssen 与 Ostrom（2010）第5章。")]

== 7. Current Theoretical Developments / 7. 当前的理论发展

#html.p(id: "en-S077")[#text("Given the half century of our own extensive empirical research and that of many distinguished scholars (e.g., Baland and Platteau 2005; Berkes 2007; Berkes, Colding, and Folke 2003; Clark 2006; Marshall 2008; Schelling 1960, 1978, 1984), where are we now? What have we learned? We now know that the earlier theories of rational, but helpless, individuals who are trapped in social dilemmas are not supported by a large number of studies using diverse methods (Faysse 2005; Poteete, Janssen, and Ostrom 2010). On the other hand, we cannot be overly optimistic and presume that dilemmas will always be solved by those involved. Many groups have struggled and failed (Dietz, Ostrom, and Stern 2003). Further, simple policy prescriptions to turn over resources to a government, to privatize, or more recently to decentralize, may also fail (Berkes 2007; Brock and Carpenter 2007; Meinzen-Dick 2007).")]

#zh(id: "S077")[#text("经过我们和许多杰出学者半个世纪的大量实证研究（例如 Baland 与 Platteau 2005；Berkes 2007；Berkes、Colding 与 Folke 2003；Clark 2006；Marshall 2008；Schelling 1960、1978、1984），我们现在处于何处？学到了什么？我们已知道，早期把个人看作理性、无助且困于社会困境中的理论，不得到大量运用不同方法的研究支持（Faysse 2005；Poteete、Janssen 与 Ostrom 2010）。但我们也不能过分乐观，假定困境总能由参与者自行解决。许多群体曾努力过，却失败了（Dietz、Ostrom 与 Stern 2003）。把资源交给政府、私有化，或近来提出的分权等简单政策处方，也可能失败（Berkes 2007；Brock 与 Carpenter 2007；Meinzen-Dick 2007）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S078")[#text("We thus face the tough task of further developing our theories to help understand and predict when those involved in a common-pool resource dilemma will be able to self-organize and how various aspects of the broad context they face affect their strategies, the short-term success of their efforts, and the long-term robustness of their initial achievements. We need to develop a better theoretical understanding of human behavior as well as of the impact of the diverse contexts that humans face.")]

#zh(id: "S078")[#text("因此，我们面对的艰巨任务，是进一步发展理论，理解并预测：公共池资源困境中的人何时能够自我组织；他们面对的广泛背景的不同方面，如何影响其策略、努力的短期成效，以及初步成就的长期稳健性。我们需要更好地从理论上理解人类行为，以及不同环境对人的影响。")]

=== A. Developing a More General Theory of the Individual / A. 发展更一般的个人理论

#html.p(id: "en-S079")[#text("As discussed earlier in section 3, efforts to explain phenomena in the social world are organized at three levels of generality. Frameworks such as the IAD that have been used to organize diverse efforts to study common-pool resources are meta-theoretical devices that help provide a general language for describing relationships at multiple levels and scales. Theories are efforts to build understanding by making core assumptions about specific working parts of frequently encountered phenomena and predicting general outcomes. Models are very specific working examples of a theory – and they are frequently confused with being theories themselves. As Alchian (1950) pointed out long ago, what is called “rational choice theory” is not a broad theory of human behavior but rather a useful model to predict behavior in a particular situation – a highly competitive market for private goods. Predictions derived from the rational choice model are empirically supported in open markets for private goods and other competitive environments (Holt 2007; Smith and Walker 1993; Satz and Ferejohn 1994). Thus, it is a useful model to retain for predicting outcomes in competitive settings related to excludable and divisible outcomes.")]

#zh(id: "S079")[#text("如第3节所述，对社会世界现象的解释可以分为三个概括层次。IAD这类框架，是组织多种公共池资源研究的元理论工具，提供描述不同层次和尺度关系的共同语言。理论则通过对常见现象中特定构件作出核心假设、预测一般结果，来建立理解。模型是理论的非常具体的实例，却经常被误认为理论本身。Alchian（1950）早已指出，所谓“理性选择理论”，不是广泛的人类行为理论，而是预测特定情境——高度竞争的私人物品市场——中行为的有用模型。它的预测在私人物品开放市场和其他竞争环境中，得到实证支持（Holt 2007；Smith 与 Walker 1993；Satz 与 Ferejohn 1994）。因此，在涉及可排他且可分割结果的竞争情境中，保留这个模型来预测结果仍然有用。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S080")[#text("While it is not possible yet to point to a single theory of human behavior that has been successfully formulated and tested in a variety of settings, scholars are currently positing and testing assumptions that are likely to be at the core of future developments (Smith 2003, 2010). These relate to (1) the capability of boundedly rational individuals to learn fuller and more reliable information in repeated situations when reliable feedback is present, (2) the use of heuristics in making daily decisions, and (3) the preferences that individuals have related to benefits for self as well as norms and preferences related to benefits for others (see Poteete, Janssen, and Ostrom 2010: chap. 9; E. Ostrom 1998).")]

#zh(id: "S080")[#text("目前，还无法指出一种已经在多种情境中成功建立并检验的人类行为统一理论，但学者正提出并检验可能成为未来发展核心的假设（Smith 2003、2010）。这些假设涉及：（1）有限理性的个人，在重复情境中得到可靠反馈时，学习更完整、更可靠信息的能力；（2）在日常决策中使用启发式；（3）个人对自身收益的偏好，以及与他人收益有关的规范和偏好（见 Poteete、Janssen 与 Ostrom 2010，第9章；E. Ostrom 1998）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S081")[#text("The assumption that individuals have complete information about all actions available to them, the likely strategies that others will adopt, and the probabilities of specific consequences that will result from their own choices, must be rejected in any but the very simplest of repeated settings. When boundedly rational individuals do interact over time, it is reasonable to assume that they learn more accurate information about the actions they can take and the likely actions of other individuals (Selten 1990; Simon 1955, 1999). Some highly complex common-pool resource environments, however, approach mathematical chaos (J. Wilson et al., 1994) in which resource users cannot gain complete information about all likely combinations of future events.")]

#zh(id: "S081")[#text("个人完全知道所有可用行动、他人可能采取的策略，以及自身选择产生特定后果的概率，这一假设除了最简单的重复情境之外，都必须放弃。当有限理性的个人长期互动时，可以合理假定，他们会学到有关自身可采取行动和他人可能行动的更准确信息（Selten 1990；Simon 1955、1999）。但某些高度复杂的公共池资源环境，接近数学上的混沌（J. Wilson 等 1994），资源使用者不可能掌握所有可能未来事件组合的完整信息。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S082")[#text("In many situations, individuals use rules of thumb – heuristics – that they have learned over time that work relatively well in a particular setting. Fishers end up “fishing for knowledge” (J. Wilson 1990) where using heuristics over time enables them to recognize diverse clues of environmental processes that they need to take into account when making their own decisions. When individuals do interact repeatedly, it is possible to learn heuristics that approach “best-response” strategies and achieve close to local optima (Gigerenzer and Selten 2001). In eras of rapid change or sudden shocks, however, heuristics may not enable individuals to achieve high payoffs.")]

#zh(id: "S082")[#text("在许多情境中，个人使用随着时间学到、在特定环境中相当有效的经验规则，即启发式。渔民最终是在“捕捞知识”（J. Wilson 1990）：长期运用启发式，使他们能够辨认决策时必须考虑的不同环境过程线索。在反复互动中，人们可以学到接近“最佳反应”策略的启发式，取得接近局部最优的结果（Gigerenzer 与 Selten 2001）。但在快速变化或突然冲击的时期，启发式可能无法带来高收益。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S083")[#text("Individuals also learn norms – internal valuations that are negative or positive related to specific actions such as lying or being brave in particular situations (Crawford and Ostrom 2005). The strength of an internal commitment (Sen 1977) may be represented in the size of the internal weight that an individual assigns to actions and outcomes in a particular setting. Among individual norms are those related to valuing outcomes achieved by others (Cox and Deck 2005; Cox, Sadiraj, and Sadiraj 2008; Andreoni 1989; Bolton and Ockenfels 2000). Fehr and Schmidt (1999) propose that individuals dislike unequal outcomes of interactions and thus have an internal norm of “inequity aversion.” Axelrod (1986) posits that individuals who adopt meta norms related to whether others follow the norms that have evolved in a group, increase the probability that norms will be followed. Leibbrandt, Gneezy, and List (2010) show that individuals who regularly work in teams are more likely to adopt norms and trust each other more than individuals working alone. Frohlich and Oppenheimer (1992) posit that many individuals adopt norms of fairness and justice. Not all individuals have the same norms or perceptions of a situation (Ones and Putterman 2007), and they may differ substantially in whether they consider a way of sharing costs to be fair (Eckel and Grossman 1996).")]

#zh(id: "S083")[#text("个人也会学习规范，即对特定行动的正面或负面内部评价，例如在某种情境中撒谎或表现勇敢（Crawford 与 Ostrom 2005）。内部承诺的强度（Sen 1977），可以表示为个人在特定环境中赋予行动和结果的内部权重大小。个人规范包括对他人所得结果的重视（Cox 与 Deck 2005；Cox、Sadiraj 与 Sadiraj 2008；Andreoni 1989；Bolton 与 Ockenfels 2000）。Fehr 和 Schmidt（1999）提出，人们不喜欢互动产生的不平等结果，因此具有“不公平厌恶”的内部规范。Axelrod（1986）认为，个人如果形成有关他人是否遵守群体规范的元规范，就能提高规范得到遵守的概率。Leibbrandt、Gneezy 和 List（2010）显示，经常团队工作的人，比独自工作的人更可能形成规范，也更信任彼此。Frohlich 和 Oppenheimer（1992）认为，许多人接受公平和正义规范。但并非所有人具有相同规范或情境认知（Ones 与 Putterman 2007），他们对于某种成本分担方式是否公平，也可能意见迥异（Eckel 与 Grossman 1996）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S084")[#text("Simply assuming that humans adopt norms, however, is not sufficient to predict behavior in a social dilemma, especially in very large groups with no arrangements for communication. Even with strong preferences to follow norms, “observed behavior may vary by context because the perception of the ‘right thing’ would change” (de Oliveira, Croson, and Eckel 2009: 19). Various aspects of the context in which individuals interact affect how individuals learn about the situation they are in and about the others with whom they are interacting. Individual differences do make a difference, but the context of interactions also affects behavior over time (Walker and Ostrom 2009). Biologists recognize that an organism’s appearance and behavior are affected by the environment in which it develops.")]

#zh(id: "S084")[#text("然而，仅仅假定人会接受规范，还不足以预测社会困境中的行为，尤其在没有交流安排的大群体中。即使遵守规范的偏好很强，“观察到的行为仍可能随背景变化，因为人们对‘正确的事’的认识会改变”（de Oliveira、Croson 与 Eckel 2009：19）。互动背景的不同方面，影响人们如何了解自身处境和互动对象。个人差异确实重要，但互动背景也影响长期行为（Walker 与 Ostrom 2009）。生物学家承认，生物体的外形和行为会受其发育环境影响。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S085")[#text("For example, some plants produce large, thin leaves (which enhance photosynthetic photon harvest) in low light, and narrow, thicker leaves (which conserve water) in high light; certain insects develop wings only if they live in crowded conditions (and hence are likely to run out of adequate food in their current location). Such environmentally contingent development is so commonplace that it can be regarded as a universal property of living things. (Pfennig and Ledón-Rettig 2009: 268)")]

#zh(id: "S085")[#text("例如，某些植物在弱光下长出宽大、薄的叶片，以增强光合作用对光子的捕获；在强光下长出狭窄、厚的叶片，以节约水分。某些昆虫只有在拥挤条件下才长出翅膀，因为它们可能在现有位置耗尽食物。这种依赖环境的发育如此普遍，可以被视为生命体的一项普遍属性。（Pfennig 与 Ledón-Rettig 2009：268）")]

#html.p(id: "en-S086")[#text("Social scientists also need to recognize that individual behavior is strongly affected by the context in which interactions take place rather than being simply a result of individual differences.")]

#zh(id: "S086")[#text("社会科学家同样需要承认，个人行为深受互动发生环境的影响，而不只是个人差异的结果。")]

=== B. The Central Role of Trust in Coping with Dilemmas / B. 信任在应对困境中的核心作用

#html.p(id: "en-S087")[#text("Even though Arrow (1974) long ago pointed to the crucial role of trust among participants as the most efficient mechanism to enhance transactional outcomes, collective-action theory has paid more attention to payoff functions than to how individuals build trust where others are reciprocators of costly cooperative efforts. Empirical studies, however, confirm the important role of trust in overcoming social dilemmas (Rothstein 2005). As illustrated in Figure 5, the updated theoretical assumptions of learning and norm-adopting individuals can be used as the foundation for understanding how individuals may gain increased levels of trust in others, leading to more cooperation and higher benefits with feedback mechanisms that reinforce positive or negative learning. It is not only that individuals adopt norms but also that the structure of the situation generates sufficient information about the likely behavior of others to be trustworthy reciprocators who will bear their share of the costs of overcoming a dilemma. Thus, in some contexts, one can move beyond the presumption that rational individuals are helpless in overcoming social dilemma situations.")]

#zh(id: "S087")[#text("阿罗（1974）早已指出，参与者之间的信任，是改善交易结果最有效的机制，但集体行动理论更关注收益函数，而不是个人如何建立信任，相信他人会回报有成本的合作努力。实证研究确认，信任对于克服社会困境十分重要（Rothstein 2005）。如图5所示，关于学习和接受规范的个人的新理论假设，可以作为理解的基础：人们如何增加对他人的信任，从而增加合作和收益，以及反馈机制如何强化正面或负面的学习。关键不只是个人接受规范，也在于情境结构是否提供充分信息，让人判断他人可能成为可信赖的互惠者，愿意承担克服困境的相应成本。因此，在某些背景中，我们能够超越“理性个人无力克服社会困境”的预设。")]

#html.figure(id: "F005", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-05.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C005", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 5. Microsituational and broader contexts of social dilemmas affect levels of trust and cooperation. Source: Poteete, Janssen, and Ostrom, 2010: 227. © Princeton University Press 2010. Republished by permission of Princeton University Press.")]

#zh(id: "C005")[#text("图5．社会困境的微观情境和更广泛背景，影响信任与合作程度。图中广泛背景变量影响微观情境变量，以及会学习和接受规范的个人；个人对其他参与者是互惠者的信任水平，继而影响合作程度与净收益，结果通过反馈影响学习。出处：Poteete、Janssen 与 Ostrom，2010：227。普林斯顿大学出版社2010年版权所有，经该出版社许可重印。")]

=== C. The Microsituational Level of Analysis / C. 微观情境层面的分析

#html.p(id: "en-S088")[#text("Asserting that context makes a difference in building or destroying trust and reciprocity is not a sufficient theoretical answer to how and why individuals sometimes solve and sometimes fail to solve dilemmas. Individuals interacting in a dilemma situation face two contexts: (1) a microcontext related to the specific attributes of an action situation in which individuals are directly interacting and (2) the broader context of the social-ecological system in which groups of individuals make decisions. A major advantage of studies conducted in an experimental lab or in field experiments is that the researcher designs the microsetting in which the experiment is conducted. Thus, empirical results are growing (and are summarized in Poteete, Janssen, and Ostrom 2010) to establish that the following attributes of microsituations affect the level of cooperation that participants achieve in social dilemma settings (including both public goods and common-pool resource dilemmas).")]

#zh(id: "S088")[#text("仅仅断言背景影响信任和互惠的建立或破坏，还不足以从理论上回答：人们为什么有时解决困境、有时失败，以及这一过程如何发生。处于困境中的个人面对两种背景：（1）微观背景，即直接互动的行动情境的具体属性；（2）更广泛的社会—生态系统背景，其中不同群体作出决策。实验室研究或田野实验的一大优势，是研究者可以设计实验所在的微观环境。因此，越来越多的实证结果——汇总见 Poteete、Janssen 与 Ostrom（2010）——表明，下列微观情境属性，影响参与者在社会困境中达到的合作程度，包括公共物品和公共池资源困境。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S089")[#text("1. Communication is feasible with the full set of participants. When face-to-face communication is possible, participants use facial expressions, physical actions, and the way that words are expressed to judge the trustworthiness of the others involved. 2. Reputations of participants are known. Knowing the past history of other participants, who may not be personally known prior to interaction, increases the likelihood of cooperation. 3. High marginal per capita return (MPCR). When MPCR is high, each participant can know that their own contributions make a bigger difference than with low MPCR and that others are more likely to recognize this relationship. 4. Entry or exit capabilities. If participants can exit a situation at low cost, this gives them an opportunity not to be a sucker and others can recognize that cooperators may leave (and enter other situations) if their cooperation is not reciprocated. 5. Longer time horizon. Participants can anticipate that more could be earned through cooperation over a long time period versus a short time. 6. Agreed-upon sanctioning capabilities. While external sanctions or imposed sanctioning systems may reduce cooperation, when participants themselves agree to a sanctioning system they frequently do not need to use sanctions at a high volume and net benefits can be improved substantially.")]

#zh(id: "S089")[#text("1. 可以与所有参与者交流。能够面对面交流时，人们通过面部表情、身体动作及言语表达方式，判断其他人的可信赖程度。2. 参与者的声誉已知。了解其他参与者的过去经历，即使互动前并不认识本人，也会提高合作概率。3. 较高的人均边际回报（MPCR）。当这一回报较高时，每个人都知道自身贡献比回报低时更有作用，其他人也更可能认识到这一关系。4. 进入或退出的能力。如果可以低成本退出，人们就有机会避免成为受骗者；其他人也会意识到，如果合作得不到回报，合作者可能离开并进入其他情境。5. 更长的时间跨度。参与者可以预期，长期合作比短期合作获得更多。6. 经共同同意的制裁能力。外部制裁或强加的制裁制度可能减少合作，但当参与者自行同意建立制裁制度时，常常不必大量使用制裁，净收益就可以显著提高。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S090")[#text("Other microsituational variables are being tested in experiments around the world. The central core of the findings is that when individuals face a social dilemma in a microsetting, they are more likely to cooperate when situational variables increase the likelihood of gaining trust that others will reciprocate.")]

#zh(id: "S090")[#text("世界各地的实验还在检验其他微观情境变量。这些发现的核心是：当个人在微观环境中面对社会困境时，如果情境变量提高了他们相信他人会互惠的可能性，合作就更容易发生。")]

=== D. The Broader Context in the Field / D. 实地中的更广泛背景

#html.p(id: "en-S091")[#text("Individuals coping with common-pool resource dilemmas in the field are also affected by a broader set of contextual variables related to the attributes of the social-ecological system (SES) in which they are interacting. A group of scholars in Europe and the U.S. are currently working on the further development of a framework that links the IAD and its interactions and outcomes at a micro level with a broader set of variables observed in the field.10 As illustrated in Figure 6, one can think of individuals interacting in an Action Situation generating Interactions and Outcomes that are affected by and affect a Resource System, Resource Units, Governance System, and Users who affect and are affected by Social, Economic, and Political Settings and Related Ecosystems (see E. Ostrom 2007, 2009). Figure 6 provides an overview of the highest tier of variables that exist in all field settings. The highest tier can be unpacked several times when one is trying to analyze specific questions related to SESs in the field, but there is not enough time or space to undertake a thorough unpacking in this article.")]

#zh(id: "S091")[#text("在实地应对公共池资源困境的个人，还受到与其社会—生态系统（SES）属性有关的更广泛背景变量影响。欧美一组学者正进一步发展框架，把IAD及其微观层面的互动和结果，与实地观察到的更广泛变量连接起来。¹⁰ 如图6所示，可以把个人理解为在行动情境中互动，产生互动与结果；这些活动既受到资源系统、资源单位、治理系统和使用者的影响，也影响它们，而这些要素又影响社会、经济、政治环境及相关生态系统，并受其影响（见 E. Ostrom 2007、2009）。图6概括了所有实地环境中最高层级的变量。分析具体社会—生态问题时，最高层级可以反复展开，但本文的时间和篇幅不足以彻底展开。")]

#html.figure(id: "F006", class: "essay-paper-figure")[
#image("assets/figure-06.png")
]

#html.p(id: "en-C006", class: "essay-original-caption")[#text("Figure 6. Action situations embedded in broader social-ecological systems. Source: Adapted from E. Ostrom, 2007: 15182.")]

#zh(id: "C006")[#text("图6．嵌入更广泛社会—生态系统的行动情境。改编自 E. Ostrom，2007：15182。图中包括社会、经济与政治环境（S），资源系统（RS），治理系统（GS），资源单位（RU），使用者（U），行动情境中的互动（I）与结果（O），以及相关生态系统（ECO）。实线箭头表示直接因果联系，虚线箭头表示反馈。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S092")[#text("Experimental researchers have reached a higher level of agreement about the impact of microsituational variables on the incentives, levels of trust, and behavior of individuals in dilemma situations than exists among field researchers. Few SES variables have a fully independent impact on the action situations that participants face and their likely behavior. The SES variables that are most important differ depending on which interactions (such as monitoring, conflict, lobbying, self-organization) or longer-term outcomes (such as overharvesting, regeneration of biodiversity, resilience of an ecological system to human and nature-induced disturbances) one wishes to predict. A set of ten variables have been identified across many field studies as impacting the likelihood of users self-organizing in order to overcome a common-pool resource dilemma (E. Ostrom 2009; Basurto and Ostrom 2009). These include: the size, productivity, and predictability of the resource system; the extent of mobility of the resource units; the existence of collective-choice rules that the users may adopt authoritatively in order to change their own operational rules; and four attributes of users (the number, the existence of leadership/entrepreneurship, knowledge about the SES, and the importance of the SES to the users). Linking the broader contextual variables and microcontextual variables is one of the major tasks facing scientists who work across disciplinary lines to understand how both social and ecological factors affect human behavior.11")]

#zh(id: "S092")[#text("关于微观情境变量如何影响困境中个人的激励、信任水平和行为，实验研究者的共识高于实地研究者。很少有SES变量能够完全独立地影响参与者面对的行动情境及其可能行为。哪些SES变量最重要，取决于希望预测的互动，例如监督、冲突、游说和自组织，或长期结果，例如过度采集、生物多样性再生，以及生态系统面对人为或自然扰动的韧性。多项田野研究识别出十个变量，影响使用者为克服公共池资源困境而自组织的可能性（E. Ostrom 2009；Basurto 与 Ostrom 2009）。包括：资源系统的规模、生产力和可预测性；资源单位的流动程度；是否存在使用者可以权威地采用、以改变自身操作规则的集体选择规则；以及使用者的四个属性——人数、是否存在领导者或创业者、对SES的知识，以及SES对使用者的重要程度。将广泛背景变量与微观背景变量连接起来，是跨学科研究社会和生态因素如何影响人类行为的科学家面对的主要任务之一。¹¹")]

== 8. Complexity and Reform / 8. 复杂性与改革

#html.p(id: "en-S093")[#text("The economic and social sciences have significantly moved ahead over the past five decades since scholars posited two optimal organizational forms, two types of goods, and one model of the individual. Extensive empirical research documents the diversity of settings in which individuals solve common-pool resource problems on their own, when these solutions are sustainable over long periods of time, and how larger institutional arrangements enhance or detract from the capabilities of individuals at smaller scales to solve problems efficiently and sustainably (see, for example, Agrawal and Gibson 2001; Gibson et al. 2005; Schlager and Blomquist 2008). While there is not yet a single well-developed theory that explains all of the diverse outcomes obtained in microsettings, such as the experimental lab, or broader contextual settings of fisheries, irrigation systems, forests, lakes, and other common-pool resources, considerable agreement does exist. Nor do we have a single normative theory of justice that can unambiguously be applied to all settings (Sen 2009).")]

#zh(id: "S093")[#text("自学者提出两种最优组织形式、两类物品和单一个人模型以来，经济学与社会科学在过去五十年中显著前进。大量实证研究记录了人们自行解决公共池资源问题的多样环境，哪些解决办法可以长期持续，以及更大制度安排如何增强或削弱较小尺度上个人高效、可持续地解决问题的能力（例如 Agrawal 与 Gibson 2001；Gibson 等 2005；Schlager 与 Blomquist 2008）。我们还没有一个充分发展的统一理论，解释实验室等微观环境，以及渔业、灌溉系统、森林、湖泊等公共池资源的更广泛环境中取得的所有不同结果，但已经形成相当程度的共识。我们也没有能够明确应用于一切环境的统一规范性正义理论（Sen 2009）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S094")[#text("Building trust in one another and developing institutional rules that are well matched to the ecological systems being used are of central importance for solving social dilemmas. The surprising but repeated finding that users of resources that are in relatively good condition – or even improving – do invest in various ways of monitoring one another relates to the core problem of building trust.")]

#zh(id: "S094")[#text("建立相互信任，以及制定与所利用生态系统充分匹配的制度规则，对于解决社会困境至关重要。一个令人惊讶、却反复出现的发现是：状况相对良好、甚至正在改善的资源的使用者，会投入不同方式的相互监督。这与建立信任这一核心问题有关。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S095")[#text("Unfortunately, policy analysts, public officials, and scholars who still apply simple mathematical models to the analysis of field settings have not yet absorbed the central lessons articulated here. All too often a single policy prescription – such as Individual Transferable Quotas (ITQs) – is recommended for all resources of a particular type, such as all fisheries. While several ITQ systems are working successfully, the time and effort needed to tailor the broad theoretical concept of an ITQ system into an operational system in a particular location involves multiple years of hard work by the fishers involved as well as the government officials (see Clark 2006; Yandle 2007; Yandle and Dewees 2003; Eggertsson 1990).")]

#zh(id: "S095")[#text("遗憾的是，仍然把简单数学模型用于实地分析的政策分析者、公共官员和学者，还没有吸收本文阐述的核心经验。人们太常为某一类型的全部资源，比如所有渔业，推荐单一政策处方，例如个人可转让配额（ITQ）。虽然一些ITQ系统运作成功，但要把其广泛理论概念，调整为特定地点可运行的系统，需要有关渔民和政府官员共同付出多年的辛勤劳动（见 Clark 2006；Yandle 2007；Yandle 与 Dewees 2003；Eggertsson 1990）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S096")[#text("The most important lesson for public policy analysis derived from the intellectual journey I have outlined here is that humans have a more complex motivational structure and more capability to solve social dilemmas than posited in earlier rational-choice theory. Designing institutions to force (or nudge) entirely self-interested individuals to achieve better outcomes has been the major goal posited by policy analysts for governments to accomplish for much of the past half century. Extensive empirical research leads me to argue that instead, a core goal of public policy should be to facilitate the development of institutions that bring out the best in humans. We need to ask how diverse polycentric institutions help or hinder the innovativeness, learning, adapting, trustworthiness, levels of cooperation of participants, and the achievement of more effective, equitable, and sustainable outcomes at multiple scales (Toonen 2010).")]

#zh(id: "S096")[#text("我在这里描述的思想历程，为公共政策分析带来的最重要经验是：人类的动机结构比早期理性选择理论设想的更复杂，解决社会困境的能力也更强。过去半个世纪的大部分时间，政策分析者提出的政府主要目标，是设计制度，迫使或轻推完全自利的个人取得更好结果。大量实证研究使我主张，公共政策的核心目标应当是促进制度发展，让制度激发人性中最好的一面。我们需要追问：不同的多中心制度，如何帮助或妨碍参与者的创新、学习、适应、可信赖程度和合作水平，以及在多个尺度上实现更有效、公平和可持续的结果（Toonen 2010）。")]

#html.p(id: "en-S097")[#text("To explain the world of interactions and outcomes occurring at multiple levels, we also have to be willing to deal with complexity instead of rejecting it. Some mathematical models are very useful for explaining outcomes in particular settings. We should continue to use simple models where they capture enough of the core underlying structure and incentives that they usefully predict outcomes. When the world we are trying to explain and improve, however, is not well described by a simple model, we must continue to improve our frameworks and theories so as to be able to understand complexity and not simply reject it.")]

#zh(id: "S097")[#text("为了说明多个层次上发生的互动和结果，我们还必须愿意处理复杂性，而不是拒绝它。某些数学模型对于解释特定环境中的结果十分有用。如果简单模型捕捉到了足够多的核心结构和激励，能够有效预测结果，我们就应继续使用。但当我们试图解释和改善的世界无法由简单模型充分描述时，就必须继续改进框架和理论，以理解复杂性，而不是将它简单排除。")]

