#zh(id: "N009")[#text("9．每个IFRI地点在收集森林使用者、活动、组织和治理安排信息的同时，都会进行大量森林测量。跨生态区比较森林指标会产生误导，因为森林的平均胸径深受降水、土壤、海拔及其他在生态区之间差异很大的因素影响。因此，我们请刚刚监督完成森林数据收集的林业专家或生态学家，在从非常稀疏到非常茂密的五级尺度上，评定森林状况。")]

#html.p(id: "en-N010")[#text("10 Scholars at the Stockholm Environment Institute, the International Institute for Applied Systems Analysis, Delft University of Technology, the University of Zurich, the Nordland Research Institute of Bodø University College, the Potsdam Institute for Climate Impact Research (PIK), Humboldt University, Marburg University, and the EU NeWATER project located at the University of Osnabrück have had several meetings in Europe to begin plans for using a common framework (initially developed by E. Ostrom 2007) to study a variety of resource systems. Scholars at the Workshop in Bloomington and the Center for the Study of Institutional Diversity at Arizona State University will also participate in this effort. A core problem identified by these scholars is the lack of cumulation across studies on diverse natural resource systems as well as humanly engineered resources.")]

#zh(id: "N010")[#text("10．斯德哥尔摩环境研究所、国际应用系统分析研究所、代尔夫特理工大学、苏黎世大学、博德大学学院的诺尔兰研究所、波茨坦气候影响研究所、洪堡大学、马尔堡大学，以及位于奥斯纳布吕克大学的欧盟NeWATER项目的学者，已在欧洲多次开会，开始规划使用共同框架——最初由 E. Ostrom（2007）提出——研究各种资源系统。布卢明顿工作坊和亚利桑那州立大学制度多样性研究中心的学者，也将参与。大家识别的核心问题是：不同自然资源系统及人工资源的研究之间，缺乏知识积累。")]

